4:
Rameki akati kuʋakadzi ʋake:
Ada naZira, inzwai inzwi raŋgu;
Imi ʋakadzi ʋaRameki, tererai ɀandinotaura;
Nokuti ndinoʋuraya munhu unondikuʋadza,
Nejaya rinondipxanya;

9:
akati:
Kanani ŋgaatukwe;
Ucaʋa muranda waʋaranda kuʋakuru ʋake.

25:
Jehova akati kwaari:
Munendudzi mbiri muciɀaro cako,
Ndudzi mbiri dzicaparadzana, dzicibva muɗumbu rako;
Rumŋe rudzi rucakunda rumŋe rudzi nesimba;
Mukuru ucashumira muɗuku.

27:
Akasweɗera, akamuȿeta; akanzwa munhuwi weŋguʋo dzake, akamuropafadza, akati:
Tarira munhuwi womŋakomana waŋgu
Wakaita somunhuwi wesaŋgo rakaropafadzwa naJehova;

Ʋanhu ŋgaʋakushumire,
Marudzi ose ŋgaakufugamire;
Uʋe ishe wehama dzako,
Ʋanakomana ʋamai ʋako ŋgaʋakufugamire;
Ʋose ʋanokutuka ŋgaʋatukwe,
Ʋose ʋanokuropafadza ŋgaʋaropafadzwe.

Ipapo Isaka ɓaɓa ʋake, akapindura, akati kwaari:
Tarira, ʋugaro bgako ʋucaʋa kure namafuta enyika,
Kure neɗoʋa rokuɗeŋga rinobva kumsoro;

Ucararama nomunondo wako, ucashumira munuŋuna wako;
Ucati kana woɀimutsa iwe,
Ucavuna joko rake ribve pamutsipa wako.

49:
Unotutuma semvura, hauŋgaʋi noʋukuru;
Nokuti wakakwira kuʋuʋato bgaɓaɓa ʋako,
Ukaʋuȿiɓisa; wakakwira kumubeda waŋgu.

Kutsamŋa kwaʋo ŋgakutukwe, nokuti kwakaŋga kuri kukuru;
Nehasha dzaʋo, nokuti dzakaŋga dzakaipa;
Ndicaʋaparadzanisa pakati paJakobo,
Nokuʋaparadzira pakati paIsraeri.

Iwe Juda, ucarumbidzwa nehama dzako;
Ruʋoko rwako rucaʋa pamitsipa yaʋaʋeŋgi ʋako,
Ʋana ʋaɓaɓa ʋako ʋacakotamira pamberi pako.

Juda mŋana weshumba;
Iwe mŋanakomana waŋgu, wakwira ucibva paneɀakaʋurawa;
Wakakotama, wakanyaŋga seshumba,
Seshumbakadzi; ndianiko ucamumutsa?

Zeburuni ucagara pamhenderekedzo dzeguŋgwa;
Iye ucaʋa mhenderekedzo panopinda ɀikepe;
Muganhu wake ucaȿika paZidoni.

Josefa iɗaʋi rinoɓereka,
Iɗaʋi rinoɓereka patsime;
Mataʋi ake anoɗarika madziro.

Benjamini iɓere rinoparadza;
Maŋgwanani ucadya cakaʋurawa,
Maɗeko ucagoʋera ɀaakapamba.

15:
Ɀino Mosesi naʋana ʋaIsraeri ʋakaimbira Jehova rwiyo urwu, ʋakataura ʋaciti:
Ndicaimbira Jehova, nokuti wakasimuka nesimba rake;
Wakakandira biza nomutaȿi waro muguŋgwa.

Jehova ndiro simba raŋgu norwiyo rwaŋgu;
Iye wakaʋa ruponeso rwaŋgu;
Uyu ndiye Mŋari waŋgu, ndicamurumbidza;
Mŋari waɓaɓa ʋaŋgu, ndicamukudza.

Nokufema kwemhino dzenyu, mvura yakaʋuŋganidzwa pamŋe cete;
Nzizi dzikamira dzikaita murwi,
Mvura yakadzika yakagwamba mukati meguŋgwa.

Muʋeŋgi wakati:
Ndicateʋerera, ndicaʋaɓata, ndicagoʋera ɀandapamba;
Kuciʋa kwaŋgu kucagutswa naʋo;
Ndicavomora munondo waŋgu, ruʋoko rwaŋgu rucaʋaparadza.

Ipapo macinda eEdomi akashamiswa,
Kuɗeɗera kwakawira ʋanhu ʋanesimba ʋeMoabi;
Ʋanhu ʋose ʋanogara Kanani ʋakanyauka.

Kutya nokuvunduka kwakaʋawira;
Ʋakanyarara sebge noʋukuru bgoruʋoko rwenyu;
Kuȿikira ʋanhu ʋenyu ʋayambuka, Jehova,
Kuȿikira ʋanhu ʋenyu ʋamakaɀitȿakira ʋayambuka.

Mucaʋapinza, nokuʋasima pagomo renhaka yenyu,
Paʋugaro bgamakaɀiitira, kuti mugare’po, Jehova;
Patȿene pakaitwa namaʋoko enyu.

Miriami akaʋapindura, akati:
Imbirai Jehova, nokuti wakasimuka nesimba rake;
Wakakandira biza nomutaȿi waro muguŋgwa.

21:
Naiɀoɀo ʋanotaura neshumo ʋanoti:
Ʋuyai muHeshboni,
Guta raSihoni ŋgariʋakwe, risimbiswe;

23:
Ipapo akataura nomufananidzo wake, akati:
Simuka, iwe Baraki, unzwe;
Nditerere, iwe mŋanakomana waZipori:

Mŋari haazi munhu, haaŋgareʋi nhema;
Kunyaŋge mŋanakomana womunhu, haaŋgashanduki;
Caakataura, haaŋgaciiti kanhi?
Caakataura, haaŋgacisimbisi kanhi?

Haana‐kuʋona ɀakaipa kunaJakobo;
Haana‐kuʋona ɀakashata kunaIsraeri;
Jehova Mŋari wake unaye,
Ʋanopupurira mambo pakati paʋo.

24:
Mŋari wakamuɓuɗisa Egipita,
Unesimba rakafanana nerenyati;
Ucapedza ʋahedeni, iʋo ʋaʋeŋgi ʋake;
Ucavuna‐vuna mafupa aʋo,
Nokuʋabvoʋora nemiseʋe yake.

Akataura nomufananidzo wake, akati:
Ɀanzi naBarami, mŋanakomana waBeori,
Ɀanzi nomurume wakaȿinudzwa meso ake;

Ndinomuʋona, asihandimuʋoni ɀino;
Ndinomuʋona, asi handimuʋoneri pedyo;
Nyeredzi icaɓuɗa kunaJakobo,
Netȿimbo yoʋushe icabva kunaIsraeri;
Icabvoʋora nyika yaMoabi,
Nokuparadza ʋanakomana ʋose ʋeɓope.

Edomi icaʋa nhaka yake,
NeSeiri ʋo icaʋa nhaka yake, ndiʋo ʋaʋeŋgi ʋake;
Asi Israeri ucakunda.

32:
Raŋgarira mazuʋa ekare,
Fuŋga makore amarudzi mazhinji;
Bvunza ɓaɓa ʋako, ndiʋo ʋacakuratidza;
Naʋatana ʋako, ndiʋo ʋacakuʋudza.

Wakamuwana munyika yesaŋgo,
Murenje risinecinhu, rinotyisa;
Wakamukomberedza, nokumutarira,
Nokumuceŋgeta semboni yeziso rake;

Ʋakamutsa goɗo raŋgu necinhu cisati ciri Mŋari;
Ʋakanditsamŋisa neɀinhu ɀaʋo ɀisinamaturo;
Neni ʋo ndicaʋagoɗoresa naʋasati ʋari ʋanhu;
Ndicaʋatsamŋisa norudzi runopeŋga.

Nokuti muzambiriŋga waʋo wakabva pamuzambiriŋga weSodoma,
Napaminda yeGomora;
Mazambiriŋga aʋo mazambiriŋga enduru,
Masumbu awo anoʋaʋa;

Tarirai ɀino,muʋone kuti ndini iye,
Hakunomumŋe mŋari pamŋe cete neni;
Ini ndinoʋuraya, ini ndinoraramisa;
Ini ndakakuʋadza, ini ndinoporesa;
Hakuna‐uŋgarwirwa paruʋoko rwaŋgu.

33:
Akati:
Jehova wakabva Sinai,
Akaʋaɓuɗira acibva Seiri;
Akapenya ari pagomo reParani,
Akaʋuya acibva paɀuru ɀinegumi ɀaʋatȿene;
Paruʋoko rwake rworudyi pakaŋga panomurairo womŋoto kwaʋari.

Ɀirokwaɀo unoɗa ndudzi;
Ʋatȿene ʋake ʋose ʋari paruʋoko rwenyu;
Ʋakagara pasi patsoka dzenyu;
Mumŋe nomumŋe ucagamucira mashoko enyu.

Kuropafadzwa kwaJuda ndiko: Akati:
Inzwai Jehova inzwi raJuda,
Mumuȿitse kuʋanhu ʋake;
Wakaʋarwira namaʋoko ake;
Imi mucamuɓatsira kurwa naʋaʋeŋgi ʋake.

Pamsoro paJosefa wakati:
Nyika yake ŋgairopafadzwe naJehova;
Ipiwe ɀinhu ɀakanakisa ɀokuɗeŋga, neɗoʋa,
Nemʋura inogara makadzika;

Mŋana wemhoŋgora weŋombe dzake, ndibgo ʋumambo bgake;
Nyaŋga dzake inyaŋga dzenyati;
Nadzo ucaɓaya ndudzi dzose dzaʋo, namagumisiro enyika;
Ndiʋo ʋaneɀuru ɀamazana ɀinegumi ɀaEfraimi,
Ndiʋo ʋaneɀuru ɀaManase.

Ʋacaɗanira ʋanhu kumakomo;
Ipapo ʋacaʋuya neɀiɓayiro ɀokururama;
Nokuti ʋacanwa fuma zhinji yamakuŋgwa,
Nefuma zhinji yakaʋanzwa nejeca.

Wakaɀitsaurira mugoʋe wokutaŋga;
Nokuti ndipapo pakaceŋgetwa mugoʋe womuɓati;
Wakaʋuya naʋakuru ʋaʋanhu;
Wakaita ɀakarurama ɀaJehova,
Neɀaakatoŋga pamsoro paIsraeri.

5:
Inzwai, imi madzimambo, tererai,
imi macinda;
Ini, iyeni, ndicaimbira Jehova;
Ndicarumbidza Jehova, Mŋari waIsraeri nenziyo.

Mŋoyo waŋgu unorumbidza ʋaɓati ʋaIsraeri,
Aʋo ʋakaʋuya nokuɗa kwaʋo pakati paʋanhu;
Kudzai Jehova!

Muka, muka, Debora;
Muka, muka, uimbe rwiyo!
Simuka Baraki, utape ʋatapxa ʋako, iwe mŋanakomana waAbinoami.

Macinda aIsakari akaŋga anaDebora;
SaIsakari, ndiɀo ɀakaŋga ɀakaita ʋo Baraki;
Ʋakamhanyira kumupata ʋaciteʋera tsoka dzake.
Pahoʋa dzaRubeni
Pakaŋga panemiraŋgariro mikuru yomŋoyo.

Wakakotama patsoka dzake, akawa,
ndokutandaʋara;
Wakakotama patsoka dzake, akawa;
Ipapo paakakotama, ndipo paakawira pasi, afa.

2:
Hana akanyeŋgetera, akati:
Mŋoyo waŋgu unofarira Jehova,
Runyaŋga rwaŋgu rwakakwiridzwa munaJehova;
Muromo waŋgu wakashamira ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu;
Nokuti ndinofarira ruponeso rwenyu.

Hakunomutȿene wakafanana naJehova;
Nokuti hakunomumŋe kunze kwenyu.
Ʋuye hakuneɗombo rakafanana naMŋari weɗu.

Ucaceŋgeta tsoka dzaʋatȿene ʋake,
Asi ʋakaipa ʋacanyaradzwa murima;
Nokuti hakunomunhu ucakunda nesimba rake.

Ʋanorwa naJehova ʋacapxanyiwa;
Ucaʋatinhirira ari kuɗeŋga;
Jehova ucatoŋga migumo yenyika;
Ucapa mambo wake simba,
Nokukwiridza runyaŋga rwomuzodzwa wake.

1:
Sauro naJonatani ʋakaŋga ʋakaɗikanwa, ʋakanaka, paʋupenyu bgaʋo;
Napakufa kwaʋo haʋana‐kuparadzaniswa;
Ʋaikurumidza kupfuʋura makondo,
Ʋaiʋa nesimba kupfuʋura shumba.

Ndinotambudzika kwaɀo pamsoro pako, munuŋuna waŋgu Jonatani;
Wakaŋga ucindifadza kwaɀo;
Ruɗo rwako kwandiri rwaishamisa,
Rwaipfuʋura ruɗo rwaʋakadzi.

3:
Maʋoko ako akaŋga asino‐kusuŋgwa, namakumbo ako akaŋga asino‐kupinzwa mumatare;
Iwe wakafa sokufa kwomunhu pamberi paʋana ʋeɀakaipa.
Ʋanhu ʋose ʋakamucema ɀe.

22:
Mŋari iɗombo raŋgu, ndicaʋimba naye;
Nhoʋo yaŋgu, norunyaŋga rwokuponeswa kwaŋgu, shoŋgwe yaŋgu yakakwirira, noʋutiziro bgaŋgu.
Muponesi waŋgu, munondiponesa pakumanikidzwa.

Ipapo nyika yakazunuŋguka, ikaɗeɗera;
Nheyo dzokuɗeŋga dzakaɗeŋgenyeka,
Dzikazunuŋguswa, nokuti iye wakaŋga atsamŋa.

Ʋutsi bgakakwira bgucibva mumhino dzake,
Ʋuye mŋoto wakaɓuɗa mumuromo make, wakaparadza;
Mazimbe akaɓatidzwa nawo.

Wakakotamisa ʋo kuɗeŋga‐ɗeŋga,
akaɓuruka;
Nerima guru rakaŋga riri pasi petsoka dzake.

Kana ari Mŋari, nzira yake yakarurama kwaɀo;
Shoko raJehova rakaidzwa;
Ndiye nhoʋo yaʋose ʋanotenda kwaari.

Ndakateʋerera ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu,
ndikaʋaparadza;
Handina‐kudzoka ɀe kuȿikira ʋapedzwa.

Unondibvisa kuʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu;
Ɀirokwaɀo, munondisimudzira kumsoro kwaʋanondimukira;
Munondirwira pamunhu unondimanikidza.

Naiɀoɀo ndicakuʋoŋgai Jehova,
pakati pendudzi,
Ndicakudza zita renyu nenziyo;

23:
Asi munhu unoigunɀa
Unofanira kutora rutare norwiriko rwepfumo;
Ipiswe kwaɀo panɀimbo yayo nomŋoto.

16:
Raŋgarirai maɓasa ake anoshamisa,
aakaita;
Ɀishamiso ɀake, neɀaakatoŋga nomuromo wake.

Ipai Jehova kukudzwa kunofanira zita rake;
Ʋuyai necipiriso, ʋuyai pamberi pake;
Namatai kunaJehova muneŋguʋo tȿene.

3:
Zuʋa iro ŋgariʋe rima;
Mŋari ŋgaarege kuriraŋgarira ari kumsoro,
Neciedza ŋgacirege kurivenekera.

Rima nomumvuri worufu ŋgaɀiritore riʋe raɀo;
Gore ŋgarigare pamsoro paro;
Ɀose ɀinoȿiɓisa zuʋa ŋgaɀirivunduse.

Kana ʋuri ʋusiku ubgo, ŋgaʋuɓatwe nerima guru;
Ŋgaʋurege kufara pakati pamazuʋa egore;
Ŋgaʋurege kurabga pakati pemŋedzi.

Nyeredzi dzamambakwedza abgo ŋgadziȿiɓe;
Ŋgaʋumirire ciedza, asi ʋucishaiwe;
Ŋgaʋurege kuʋona fuŋgiro dzameso amaŋgwanani;

4:
Wakamira, asi ndakaŋga ndisiŋgagoni kuʋona kuti wakaɗini;
Mufananidzo wakaŋga uri pamberi pameso aŋgu;
Kunyararakukaʋa’po, ndikanzwa inzwiriciti:

5:
Ʋana ʋaro haʋatoŋgoponeswi,
Ʋanopxanyiwa musuʋo;
Hapana‐unoʋarwira.

Ɀaakaceka ɀinodyiwa naʋanenzara,
Ʋanoɀitora kunyaŋge napakati peminzwa;
Ʋanenyota ʋanonwa fuma yaʋo.

6:
Nokuti miseʋe yoWamasimba yakandiɓaya mukati maŋgu,
Mŋeya waŋgu unonwa ʋuturu bgayo;
Ɀinotyisa ɀaMŋari ɀaɀigadzirira kurwa neni.

Ipapo ndainyaradzwa haŋgu;
Ɀirokwaɀo ndaifara pakurwadziwa kusinetsitsi;
Nokuti handina‐kuramba mashoko oMutȿene.

7:
Kana ndoʋata, ndinoti:
Ndicamuka riniko? Asi ʋusiku bgakareɓa;
Ndinoramba ndicishanduka‐shanduka kuȿikira kwoedza.

Saka handiŋganyarari nomuromo waŋgu;
Ndicataura pakutambudzika kwomŋeya waŋgu;
Ndicanyunyuta neshuŋgu dzaŋgu dzomŋoyo.

Munoregereiko kukaŋganwira kuɗarika kwaŋgu, nokubvisa kutadza kwaŋgu?
Nokuti ɀino ndicaʋata pasi muguruʋa;
Mucanditȿaka ɀikuru, asi handicazoʋi’po.

8:
Kana ukaʋa wakanaka, wakarurama;
Iye uŋgaɗai aimuka ɀino nokuɗa kwako,
Akafambisa ɀakanaka imba yako yakarurama.

9:
Nyika yakaiswa mumaʋoko aʋakaipa;
Iye unofukidza meso aʋatoŋgi ʋayo;
Kana asiriiye, ɀino ndianiko?

10:
Mŋoyo waŋgu waneta noʋupenyu bgaŋgu;
Handiŋgaɀidzori pakunyunyuta kwaŋgu;
Ndicataura neshuŋgu dzomŋoyo waŋgu.

Kana ndiri wakaipa, ndinenhamo;
Kana ndiri wakarurama, kunyaŋge ɀakaɗaro handiŋgasimudzi musoro waŋgu;
Ɀandizere nokunyadzwa
Ndiciŋgotarira kutambudzika kwaŋgu.

Munowedzera ɀapupu ɀenyu kuzorwa neni,
Nokuwanza kutsamŋa kwenyu pamsoro paŋgu;
Kushanduka nehondo ɀineni.

Iyo nyika yerima guru, rima cairo;
Nyika yomumvuri worufu, panokukaŋganiswa,
Ipapo ciedza cakafanana nerima.

12:
Asi ini ndinenjere ʋo semi;
Handizi muɗuku kwamuri;
Ɀirokwaɀo, ndianiko usiŋgaziʋi ɀinhu ɀakaɗai?

Ndakafanana nomunhu unosekwa nowaanogara naye,
Munhu wakaɗana kunaMŋari, iye akamupindura;
Munhu wakarurama, wakakwana, ndiye wosekwa.

Matente amakororo anofara hawo,
Aʋo ʋanotsamŋisa Mŋari ʋanogara haʋo ɀakanaka;
Iʋo ʋanozadzirwa ruʋoko rwaʋo naMŋari.

14:
Saiɀoɀo munhu unoʋata pasi, akasamuka ɀe;
Haʋazomuki ɀe kuȿikira ɗeŋga rapera,
Haʋaŋgamutswi pahope dzaʋo.

Mvura inocera mabge;
Kuyerera kwayo kunokukura guruʋa renyika;
Imi munoparadza tariro yomunhu.

15:
Haaŋgabvi parima;
Muraɀo womŋoto ucawomesa mataʋi ake,
Ucabviswa nomŋeya womuromowaMŋari.

16:
Imi makandiɓata nesimba, ndiɀo ɀinondipupurira;
Kuwonda kwaŋgu kunondimukira,
Kunondipupurira ɀakaipa pacena.

Iye wakandibvarura pakutsamŋa kwake, akandiʋeŋga;
Wakarumanya meno ake pamsoro paŋgu;
Mudziʋisi waŋgu unondiwetsera meso ake.

Ʋakandishamisira miromo yaʋo;
Ʋakandiroʋa paɗama, ʋacindituka;
Ʋanoʋuŋgana kuzorwa neni.

Ndakaŋga ndicizorora haŋgu, iye akandivuna;
Ɀirokwaɀo wakandiɓata nomumutsipa, akandiputsanya;
Wakandiita ciposherwa cake.

Miseʋe yake inondikomba kumatiʋi ose;
Unopamura itȿo dzaŋgu, asiŋganzwiri nyasha;
Unoɗururira nduru yaŋgu pasi.

19:
Ndicamuʋona ari kurutiʋi rwaŋgu;
Meso aŋgu acaʋona, asati ari omutorwa;
Itȿo dzaŋgu dzapera mukati maŋgu.

Ityai munondo;
Nokuti kutsamŋa kucarobga nomunondo,
Kuti muziʋe kuti kutoŋga kuri’po.

20:
Unoivomora, ikaɓuɗa pamuʋiri wake;
Muromo wayo unobginya, unoɓuɗa panduru yake;
Unotya kwaɀo.

Wakaceŋgetererwa rima guru iʋe fuma yake,
Mŋoto usina‐kupfutidzwanomunhu ucamuparadza;
Ucapedza ɀakasara patente rake.

24:
Tarira, sembizi murenje
Ʋanoɓuɗira kumaɓasa aʋo, ʋacishiŋgairira ɀokwaɗi;
Renjerinoʋapa ɀokudya ɀaʋana ʋaʋo.

Ʋanhu ʋanogomera mukati meguta rinaʋanhu ʋazhinji,
Ʋuye mŋeya yaʋakakuʋadzwa inocema;
Kunyaŋge ɀakaɗaro Mŋari haanehanya neɀisina‐kururama.

Ndiʋo ʋanoʋeŋga ciedza;
Haʋaziʋi nzira dzaco,
Haʋarambi ʋacifamba pamakwara aco.

Ziso remhombge ʋo rinomirira rubvunza‐ʋaeni,
Aciti: Hakuneziso ricandiʋona;
Ndokufukidza ciso cake.

Ʋusiku ʋanopaza dzimba;
Masikati ʋanoɀipfigira;
Haʋaziʋi ciedza.

Iye unofambisa pamsoro pemvura;
Mugoʋe waʋo wakatukwa panyika;
Haacafambi nenzira yeminda yemizambiriŋga.

Ciɀaro cicamukaŋganwa; honye dzicatapirirwa naye;
Haacazoraŋgarirwi;
Ʋuye kusarurama kucavunwa somuti.

Ʋanokudzwa; gare‐gare ʋaenda;
Ʋanoɗukupiswa, ʋanobviswa panzira saʋamŋe ʋose,
Ʋanocekwa semisoro yehura dzeɀiyo.

26:
Tarira, iɀi ndiwo mudziʋo woga wenzira dzake;
Haiwa, tinoŋgonzwa zeʋe‐zeʋe roga renzwi rake!
Asi kutinhira kwesimba rake ndianiko uŋgakunzwisisa?

28:
Unocera mugodi kure napanogara ʋanhu;
Ʋanokaŋganikwa norutsoka rwaʋanopfuʋura;
Ʋanorembera kure naʋanhu, ʋacizeya uku nokuku.

Akaʋudza munhu aciti:
Tarira, Kutya Ishe, ndibgo ʋucenjeri;
Kurega ɀakaipa ndiko kunzwisisa.

30:
Ʋasinamaturo ʋanosimuka kurudyi rwaŋgu;
Ʋanosundira makumbo aŋgu,
Ʋanoɀigadzirira nzira dzaʋo kundiparadza.

Ɀinotyisa ɀandiʋiŋga,
Ʋanodziŋga kukudzwa kwaŋgu semhepo;
Kufara kwangu kwapfuʋura segore.

31:
Kana kutsika kwaŋgu kuciŋge kwatsauka panzira,
Nomŋoyo waŋgu ukateʋera meso aŋgu,
Kana gwapa riciŋge ranamatira pamaʋoko aŋgu;

32:
Ɀino Erihu mŋanakomana waBarakeri muBuzi wakapindura, akati:
Ini ndiri muɗuku, asi imi maʋa ʋakuru kwaɀo;
Saka ndakaɀidzora haŋgu, ndikatya kukuziʋisai kufuŋga kwaŋgu.

33:
Pakurota, kana pane‐ɀinoʋonekwa ʋusiku,
Kana munhu aɓatwa nehope kwaɀo,
Kana aʋete panhoʋo;

Kana mutumŋa akaȿika kwaari,
Ari mushanduri, mumŋe pakati paʋaneɀuru ɀamazana,
Kuti aratidze munhunzira yakarurama;

Unonyeŋgetera kunaMŋari, iye acimufarira;
Naiɀoɀo unotarira ciso cake nomufaro;
Akadzosera munhu kururama kwake.

Ucaimba pamberi paʋanhu, aciti;
Ndatadza, ndakaŋganisa ɀakarurama,
Asi haɀina‐kundiɓatsira;

34:
Saka cindinzwai, imi ʋarume ʋenjere:
Mŋari haaŋgatoŋgoiti ɀisakarurama;
Wamasimba‐ose haaŋgatoŋgoiti ɀakaipa.

Ʋanofa kamŋe‐kamŋe pakati poʋusiku;
Ʋanhu ʋanozozunuŋguswa ndokuparara haʋo,
Ʋanesimba ʋanobviswa ɀisiŋgaitwi noruʋoko.

Kana iye akazorodza, ndianiko uŋgapa mhoȿa?
Kana akaʋanza ciso cake, ndianiko uŋgazomuʋona?
Kanaɀiciitirwa rudzi kana munhu mumŋe, ɀakafanana haɀo;

Ko iye ucatsiʋa seɀaunoɗa iwe, ɀaunoɀiramba here?
Nokuti ndiwe unofanira kusanaŋgura, handizi’ni;
Saka citaura ɀaunoziʋa.

36:
Haaregi kutarira ʋakarurama nameso ake;
Asi unoʋagarisa pacigaro coʋushe pamŋe cete namadzimambo,
Unoʋagarisa nokusiŋgaperi, ʋacikudzwa.

Ɀirokwaɀo, wakaŋga aciɗa kukubvisai panjodzi
Kukuȿitsai panɀimbo yakafara, pasina‐kumanikana;
Kuti ɀinoiswa patafura yenyu ɀiʋe ɀizere namafuta.

37:
Nokuti unoti kucando: Ciwira panyika;
Saiɀoɀo ʋo kumvura inopfunhapfunha,
Ʋuye ʋo kumvura inoturuka nesimba.

Rinotendeʋudzwa nokufambisa kwake,
Kuti ɀiite ɀose ɀaanoɀiraira
Panyika inogarwa naʋanhu;

2:
Ndicaparidza cireʋo,cinoti:
Jehova wakati kwandiri: Ndiwe mŋanakomana waŋgu;
Nhasi ndakakuɓereka.

3:
Simukai, Jehova; ndirwirei, Mŋari waŋgu;
Nokuti makaroʋa ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu ʋose pashaya dzaʋo;
Makavuna meno aʋakaipa.

4:
Ndipindurei kana ndiciɗana, Mŋari wokururama kwaŋgu;
Pakumanikidzwa kwaŋgu makandiisa pakafarikana;
Ndinzwirei tsitsi, munzwe munyeŋgetero waŋgu.

5:
Nokuti hapana‐kutendeka pamiromo yaʋo;
Mukati maʋo makashata‐shata;
Huro dzaʋo bgiro bgakashama;
Ʋanoɓata kumeso norurimi rwaʋo.

Muʋapei mhoȿa, Jehova;
Ŋgaʋawe namano aʋo;
Muʋadziŋge nokuɗa kwokuwanda kwokuɗarika kwaʋo;
Nokuti ʋakakumukirai.

Asi ʋose ʋanoʋimba nemi ŋgaʋafare,
Ŋgaʋaɗanidzire nomufaro ŋguʋa dzose, nokuti imi munoʋadzitira;
Ʋose ʋanoɗa zita renyu ŋgaʋafare nemi.

6:
Ndaneta nokugomba kwaŋgu;
Ʋusiku ʋumŋe noʋumŋe ndinoshambirisa nhoʋo dzaŋgu;
Ndinonyoroɀa mubeda waŋgu nemisodzi yaŋgu.

7:
Muʋeŋgi ŋgaateʋerere mŋeya waŋgu, auɓate;
Ŋgaatsikire ʋupenyu bgaŋgu pasi,
Aise kukudzwa kwaŋgu muguruʋa.

Simukai Jehova, pakutsamŋa kwenyu,
Simukirai hasha dzaʋadziʋisi ʋaŋgu;
Mumuke nokuɗa kwaŋgu; ndimi makaraira kuti ɀakarurama ɀiitwe.

9:
Ʋaʋeŋgi ʋakapera, ʋakaparadzwa nokusiŋgaperi;
Makaparadza maguta aʋo,
Neciyeʋudzo cawo cakaparara.

Ndinzwirei tsitsi, Jehova;
Tarirai kumanikidzwa kwaŋgu naʋanondiʋeŋga,
Imi munondisimudza pamisuʋo yorufu;

Kuti ndiparidze kurumbidzwa kwenyu kwose;
Pamisuʋo yomukunda weZioni,
Ndicafarira kuponesa kwenyu.

10:
Nzira dzake dzakasimba ŋguʋa dzose;
Ɀamunotoŋga imi ɀiri kure kumsoro, haaɀiʋoni;
Kana ʋari ʋadziʋisi ʋake ʋose, unoʋashoʋora.

Unogara panɀimbo dzokuʋanda dzemisha;
Pakaʋanda ndi’po paanoʋuraya usinemhoȿa;
Meso ake anoʋandira usina‐wokumuɓatsira.

Unoʋandira pakaʋanda seshumba panɀimba yayo;
Unoʋanda kuti aɓate murombo;
Unoɓata murombo, kana acimukakatira mumumbure wake.

Maɀiʋona henyu; nokuti munoʋona kutambudzika nokucema, kuti muɀiɓate muruʋoko rwenyu;
Usinomuɓatsiri unoɀiisa kwamuri;
Makaʋa muɓatsiri wenherera.

11:
Ndinoʋimba naJehova;
Munoreʋa seiko kumŋeya waŋgu,muciti:
Tizira kugomo rako seshiri?

Jehova uri mutembere yake tȿene,
Iye Jehova, cigaro cake coʋushe ciri kuɗeŋga;
Meso ake anotarira, mafuŋgiro ameso ake anoidza ʋana ʋaʋanhu.

12:
Nokuɗa kwokumanikidzwa kwaʋarombo, nokugomera kwaʋanoshaiwa,
Ndicamuka ɀino nokuɗa kwaiɀoɀo: ndiɀo ɀinotaura Jehova;
Ndicamuisa pakasimba ipo paanoshuʋa.

Mashoko aJehova mashoko akacena;
Sesirveri yakaidzwa muɓisiro panyika,
Yakanatswa kanomŋe.

14:
Ƃenzi rakati mumŋoyo maro: Mŋari haako.
Ʋakaʋora, ʋakaɓata maɓasa anonyaŋgadza;
Hapana‐unoita ɀakanaka.

15:
Munhu wakashata unoɀidzwa naye;
Asi unokudza ʋanotya Jehova.
Iye unoti kana aciŋge apika, haaŋgazoshandurishoko rake, kunyaŋge ɀikaʋa ɀakaipa kwaari.

16:
Kucema kucawanzwa kwaʋanoʋigira mumŋemŋari ɀipo;
Ɀipiriso ɀaʋo ɀinoɗururwa ɀeropa handiŋgaɀiɗururi,
Namazita aʋo handiŋgaareʋi nemiromo yaŋgu.

Mucandiratidza nzira yoʋupenyu;
Mufaro wakazara uri pamberi paŋgu;
Paruʋoko rwenyu rworudyi paneɀinofadza nokusiŋgaperi.

17:
Makaidza mŋoyo waŋgu; makandishanyira ʋusiku;
Makandiidza, mukasawana kufuŋga kwakaipa mandiri;
Ndakaɀisuŋga kuti muromo waŋgu urege kuɗarika.

Simukai, Jehova,
Mirai pamberi pake, mumuwisire pasi;
Rwirai mŋeya waŋgu nomunondo wenyu kunaʋakaipa;

18:
Jehova iɗombo raŋgu, nenhare yaŋgu, nomurwiri waŋgu;
Mŋari waŋgu, ɗombo raŋgu, wandicaʋimba naye;
Nhoʋo yaŋgu, norunyaŋga rwokuponeswa kwaŋgu, shoŋgwe yaŋgu yakakwirira.

Pakutambudzika kwaŋgu ndakaɗana kunaJehova,
Ndikaɗana kunaMŋari waŋgu;
Akanzwa inzwi raŋgu ari mutembere yake;
Kucema kwaŋgu pamberi pake kukaȿika munzeʋe dzake.

Ipapo nyika yakazunuŋguka, ikaɗeɗera;
Nheyo dzamakomo ʋo dzakaɗeŋgenyeka,
Dzikazunuŋguswa, nokuti wakaŋga akatsamŋa.

Ʋutsi bgakakwira ʋucibva mumhino dzake,
Ʋuye mŋoto wakaɓuɗa mumuromo make, wakaparadza;
Mazimbe akaɓatidzwa nawo.

Jehova wakatinhira ʋo kuɗeŋga‐ɗeŋga,
Wokumsoro‐soro wakataura nenzwi rake;
Cimvuramabge namazimbe omŋoto.

Kana ari Mŋari, nzira yake yakakwana kwaɀo;
Shoko raJehova rakaidzwa;
Ndiye nhoʋo yaʋose ʋanoʋimba naye.

Makandipa ʋo nhoʋo yokuponesa kwenyu;
Ruʋoko rwenyu rworudyi rwakanditsigira,
Ʋuye ʋunyoro bgenyu bgakandiita mukuru.

Makandirwira pakukakaʋadzana kwaʋanhu;
Makandiita mukuru wendudzi;
Ʋanhu ʋandakaŋga ndisiŋgaziʋi, ʋacandishumira.

Iye unondirwira kuʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu;
Ɀirokwaɀo, munondisimudzira kumsoro kwaʋanondimukira.
Munondirwira pamunhu unomanikidza.

Unopa mambo wake kuponeswa kukuru;
Unoitira muzodzwa wake ʋunyoro,
Iye Davidi nomŋana wake nokusiŋgaperi.

19:
Kuɓuɗa kwaro kunobva pamugumo weɗeŋga,
Kupota kwaro kunoȿika pakuguma kwaro ɀe;
Hakune‐cinhu cakaʋanzirwa kupisa kwaro.

Ʋuye ɀe, muranda wenyu unonyeʋerwa naɀo;
Pakuɀiceŋgeta panomuɓairo mukuru.
Kana kuri kutsauka, ndiani uŋgakuziʋa?

Dzorai ʋo muranda wenyupaɀiʋi ɀokuɀikudza;
Ŋgaɀirege kuʋa nesimba pamsoro paŋgu; ipapo ndicaʋa wakakwana,
Handiŋgaʋi nemhoȿa yokuɗarika kukuru.

20:
Ticafara kwaɀo nokukunda kwenyu,
Ticasimudza mireza yeɗu nezita raMŋari weɗu;
Jehova ŋgaaite ɀose ɀawakakumbira.

Ɀino ndinoziʋa kuti Jehova unoponesa muzodziwa wake;
Ucamupindura ari kuɗeŋga kwake kutȿene
Nesimba roruʋoko rwake rworudyi, rinoponesa.

22:
Ndakaɗururwa semvura,
Mafupa aŋgu ose akaȿoɗogoka;
Mŋoyo waŋgu wakafanana nenamo;
Wakanyauka mukati moʋura bgaŋgu.

Simba raŋgu rakawoma secaeŋga;
Rurimi rwaŋgu rwakanamatira pashaya dzaŋgu;
Makandiisa paguruʋa rorufu.

Nokuti imbga dzakandikomberedza;
Ʋuŋgano yaʋanoita ɀakaipa yakandipoteredza;
Ʋakabvoʋora maʋoko aŋgu namakumbo aŋgu;

Imi munotya Jehova, murumbidzei;
Imi mose ʋana ʋaJakobo, mukudzei;
Mumutyei, imi mose ʋana ʋaIsraeri.

Nokuti haana‐kuɀidza kana kusema ɗambudziko rounotambudzwa;
Kana kumuʋanzira ciso cake;
Asi paŋguʋa yaakacema kwaari wakamunzwa.

Ʋanyoro ʋacadya ʋakaguta;
Ʋanotȿaka Jehova ndiʋo ʋacamurumbidza;
Mŋoyo yenyu ŋgairarame nokusiŋgaperi.

Ʋakuru ʋose ʋenyika ʋacadya nokunamata;
Ʋose ʋanoɓurukira kuguruʋa ʋacafugama pamberi pake,
Naiye usiŋgagoni kuraramisa mŋeya wake.

23:
Ɀirokwaɀo, kunyaŋge ndikafamba mumupata womumvuri worufu,
Handiŋgatoŋgotyi ɀakaipa; nokuti imi mune’ni;
Tȿimbo yenyu nomuɗonɀo wenyu ɀinondinyaradza.

24:
Uyo unamaʋoko akacena, nomŋoyo wakanaka kwaɀo;
Usiŋgasimudziri mŋoyo wake kuneɀisinamaturo,
Nousina‐kupika nhema.

Simudzai misoro yenyu, imi masuʋo;
Musimudzwe imi, magonhi akarekare;
Kuti Mambo wokubginya apinde.

Simudzai misoro yenyu, imi masuʋo;
Muisimudze, imi magonhi akarekare;
Kuti Mambo wokubginya apinde.

25:
Mŋari waŋgu, ndinoʋimba nemi,
Ŋgandirege kunyadziswa;
Ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu ŋgaʋarege kundikunda.

Ndiperekedzei muɀokwaɗi yenyu, mundidzidzise;
Nokuti ndimi Mŋari muponesi waŋgu;
Ndinokutarirai zuʋa rose.

Regai kuraŋgarira ɀiʋi ɀoʋuɗoko bgaŋgu, nokuɗarika kwaŋgu;
Mundiraŋgarire noʋunyoro bgenyu,
Nokuɗa kwokunaka kwenyu, Jehova.

27:
Cinhu cimŋe cete ndakakumbira kunaJehova, ndico candicatȿaka;
Kuti ndigare mumba maJehova misi yose yoʋupenyu bgaŋgu,
Kuti ndiʋone kunaka kwaJehova, nokuraŋgarira mutembere yake.

Nokuti nomusi wenjodzi unondiʋiga muɗumba rake,
Ucandiʋanza pakaʋanda patente rake;
Ucandikwiridza paɗombo.

Ɀino musoro waŋgu ucasimudzirwa kumsoro kwaʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu ʋanondikomba;
Ndicamuɓayira ɀiɓayiro ɀomufaro patente rake.
Ndicaimba, ɀirokwaɀo ndicaimbira Jehova nziyo dzokumurumbidza.

Regai kundiʋanzira ciso cenyu;
Musadziŋga muranda wenyu pakutsamŋa kwenyu;
Makaŋga muri muɓatsiri waŋgu;
Regai kundirasha, kana kundisiya, imi Mŋari muponesi waŋgu.

Ndidzidzisei nzira yenyu Jehova;
Mundifambise panzira yakati cecetere,
Nokuɗa kwaʋanondiʋandira.

Rindira Jehova;
Iʋa nesimba, nomŋoyo wako utsuŋge;
Ndinoti, rindira Jehova.

28:
Ndicaɗana kwamuri, Jehova;
Ƌombo raŋgu, regai kundinyararira;
Ɀimŋe, kana mukandinyararira,
Ndiŋgafanana naʋanoɓurukira kugomba.

Muʋape ɀakaenzana neɓasa raʋo, ʋuye ɀakaenzana neɀakaipa ɀaʋakaita,
Muʋape ɀakaenzana nokuɓata kwamaʋoko aʋo;
Muʋaitire seɀakaʋafanira.

Jehova ndiye simba raŋgu nenhoʋo yaŋgu;
Mŋoyo waŋgu wakaʋimba naye, ndikaɓatsirwa;
Saka mŋoyo waŋgu unofara kwaɀo,
Ndicamurumbidza norwiyo rwaŋgu.

29:
Inzwi raJehova riri pamsoro pemvura zhinji;
Mŋari wokubginya unotinhira,
Iye Jehova uri pamsoro pemvura zhinji‐zhinji:

Inzwi raJehova rinoɓerekesa nondo,
Rinoȿuʋuramiti yamatondo;
Nomutembere yake ɀose ɀinoti: Kubginya.

31:
Ndicafara nokufarisisa netsitsi dzenyu;
Nokuti makaʋona kutambudzika kwaŋgu;
Makaziʋa kumanikidzwa kwomŋeya waŋgu;

Ndaʋa cinhu cinoɀidzwa nemhaka yaʋadziʋisi ʋaŋgu ʋose,
Ɀirokwaɀo, ɀikuru kunaʋandinogara naʋo, necinotyisa kuʋazikani ʋaŋgu;
Ʋakandiʋona kunze ʋakanditiza.

Miromo inoreʋa nhema ŋgainyarare;
Iyo inotaura namanyawi kunaʋakarurama,
Iciɀikudza nokuʋaɀidza.

Iɗai Jehova, imi ʋatȿene ʋake mose;
Jehova unoceŋgeta ʋakatendeka,
Unotsiʋa ɀikuru munhu unoɀikudza.

32:
Ndakakuziʋisai ciʋi caŋgu, handina‐kuʋanza cakaipa caŋgu;
Ndakati: Ndicaɀireʋurura kuɗarika kwaŋgu kunaJehova;
Imi mukandikaŋganwira kuipa kweciʋi caŋgu.

Regai kuʋa sebiza, kana sehesera, ɀisiŋganzwisisi;
Ɀinofanira kufambiswa norwauro netomu pamakashu aɀo,
Haɀiŋgazoɗi kusweɗera kwauri.

35:
Kuparadzwa ŋgakumuwire akaŋgofara;
Ʋuye mumbure wake waakaʋanza ŋgaumuɓate amene;
Ŋgaawire’mo aparadzwe.

Asi kana ndiri’ni, pakurwara kwaʋo ndakafuka gumbu;
Ndakatambudza mŋeya waŋgu ndiciɀinyima ɀokudya;
Munyeŋgetero waŋgu ukadzokera kucifuʋa caŋgu.

Asi pakugumburwa kwaŋgu ʋakafara, ʋakaʋuŋgana pamŋe cete;
Ʋanhu ʋakashata kwaɀo ʋakaʋuŋgana kuzorwa neni, naʋandakaŋga ndisiŋgaziʋi;
Ʋakandibvambura, ʋasiŋgaregi;

Ŋgaʋaɗanidzire nomufaro, ʋafare, iʋo ʋanoɗa kururamiswa kwemhaka yaŋgu;
Ŋgaʋarambe ʋaciti: Jehova ŋgaakudzwe,
Iye, unofarira kufara kwomuranda wake.

36:
Unofuŋga ɀakaipa panhoʋo dzake;
Unofamba nenzira isina‐kunaka;
Haasemi ɀakaipa.

Kururama kwenyu kwakafanana namakomo aMŋari;
Kutoŋga kwenyu kwakadzika ɀikuru;
Jehova, munoceŋgeta ʋanhu nemhuka.

37:
Nyarara pamberi paJehova, umurindire unyerere;
Usaʋa neshuŋgu pamsoro pounofara panzira yake,
Pamsoro pomunhu unoita mano akaipa aakafuŋga.

Ʋakaipa ʋakavomora munondo, ʋakawembura ʋuta bgaʋo;
Kuti ʋawisire pasi ʋarombo naʋanoshaiwa,
Kuti ʋaʋuraye ʋakarurama panzira;

Asi ʋakaipa ʋacaparara,
Ʋuye ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaJehova ʋacafanana nokunaka kwamafuro;
Ʋacaroʋa; ʋacaroʋa soʋutsi.

Ndakaŋga ndiri muɗuku, ɀino ndakwegura;
Kunyaŋge ɀakaɗaro handina‐kutoŋgoʋona wakarurama acisiyiwa,
Kana ʋana ʋake ʋacipemha ɀokudya.

Nokuti Jehova unoɗa ɀakarurama,
Haasiyi ʋatȿene ʋake;
Ʋanoceŋgetwa nokusiŋgaperi;
Asi ʋana ʋowakaipa ʋacaparadzwa.

Rindira Jehova, urambire panzira yake,
Iye ucakukudza kuti ugare nhaka yenyika;
Kana ʋakaipa ʋaciparadzwa iwe ucaɀiʋona.

Jehova unoʋaɓatsira, nokuʋarwira;
Unoʋarwira kunaʋakaipa, nokuʋaponesa,
Nokuti ʋakandoʋanda maari.

38:
Ʋanotȿaka ʋupenyu bgaŋgu ʋanonditeyira misuŋgo;
Ʋuye ʋanotȿaka kundikuʋadza ʋanotaura ɀokuparadzwakwaŋgu,
Asi ʋanofuŋga kundinyeŋgera zuʋa rose.

39:
Mŋoyo waŋgu wakaŋga ucipisa mukati maŋgu;
Ndakati ndicifuŋga, mŋoto ukapfuta;
Ipapo ndakataura norurimi rwaŋgu,ndikati:

Jehova, ndiziʋisei mugumo waŋgu,
Ʋuye mŋero wamazuʋa aŋgu, kuti akaɗini;
Ndiziʋisei kuti ndinoŋgopfuʋura haŋgu.

Tarirai, makaita mazuʋa aŋgu soʋupamhi bgecanza;
Ʋuye ŋguʋa yokurarama kwaŋgu secinhu cisi’po pamberi penyu;
Ɀirokwaɀo, munhu mumŋe nomumŋe kunyaŋge akasimba kwaɀo, mŋeya ɓedzi.

Ɀirokwaɀo, munhu mumŋe nomumŋe unofamba‐famba somumvuri;
Ɀirokwaɀo, ʋanoita ɓope pasina;
Unoʋuŋganidzafuma, asi haaziʋi kuti ndiani ucaidya.

Kana muciraira munhu mucimuraŋga pamsoro peɀakaipa,
Munopedza kunaka kwake seciʋundudzi;
Ɀirokwaɀo munhu mumŋe nomumŋe mŋeya hake.

Inzwai munyeŋgetero waŋgu, Jehova, rerekerai nzeʋe yenyu munzwe kucema kwaŋgu;
Musanyararamuciʋona misodzi yaŋgu;
Nokuti ndiri mŋeni kwamuri,
Mutorwa, seɀakaŋga ɀakaita madziɓaɓa aŋgu ose.

40:
Akaisa rwiyo rutȿa mumuromo maŋgu, rwokurumbidza Mŋari weɗu narwo;
Ʋazhinji ʋacaɀiʋona, ʋacitya,
Ʋacaʋimba naJehova.

Imi hamufadzwi neɀiɓayiro neɀipiriso;
Makandidziʋurira nzeʋe dzaŋgu;
Ɀipiriso ɀinopiswa neɀeɀiʋi hamuna‐kuɀireʋa.

Ndakaparidza mashoko omufaro paʋuŋgano huru;
Tarirai, handiŋgadzori miromo yaŋgu,
Jehova, munoɀiziʋa.

Handina‐kuʋanza kururama kwenyu mumŋoyo maŋgu;
Ndakaɗudzira kutendeka kwenyu nokuponesa kwenyu;
Handina‐kuʋanzira ʋuŋgano huru ʋunyoro bgenyu neɀokwaɗi yenyu.

Nokuti maɗambudzo asiŋgaʋereŋgwi akandikomberedza,
Ɀakaipa ɀaŋgu ɀakandiɓata, naiɀoɀo handigoni kutarira kumsoro;
Ɀakawanda kupfuʋura vudzi romusoro waŋgu, ndapera mŋoyo.

Ʋose ʋanokutȿakai ŋgaʋafarise ʋaʋe nomufaro mamuri;
Ʋanoɗa kuponesa kwenyu ŋgaʋarambe ʋaciti:
Jehova ŋgaakudzwe!

Asi ini ndiri murombo nomushaiwi;
Kunyaŋge ɀakaɗaro Ishe unondifuŋga;
Imi muri muɓatsiri waŋgu nomurwiri waŋgu;
Regai kunonoka, Mŋari waŋgu.

41:
Kana mumŋe aciʋuya kuzondiʋona, unotaura ɀisinamaturo;
Mŋoyo wake unoɀiʋuŋganidzira ɀakaipa;
Kana oɓuɗa kumŋe, unoɀiparidza.

42:
Haiwa Mŋari, mŋeya waŋgu unoshuwa mukati maŋgu;
Naiɀoɀo ndinokuraŋgarirai ndiri panyika yaJoridani,
Napamakomo eHermoni, necikomo ceMizari.

43:
Tumai ciedza cenyu neɀokwaɗi yenyu; ɀindituŋgamirire;
Ɀindiȿitse kugomo renyu dɀene,
Nokutabernakeri dzenyu.

Ipapo ndicaȿika kuartari yaMŋari,
KunaMŋari, iye mufaro waŋgu mukuru;
Ndicakurumbidzai nembira, imi Mŋari, Mŋari waŋgu.

45:
Mŋoyo waŋgu unotutuma namashoko akanaka;
Ndinotaura ɀinhu ɀandakaita ɀinoreʋa mambo;
Rurimi rwaŋgu ipeni yomunyori unokurumidza kunyora.

Imi makanaka‐naka kupfuʋura ʋana ʋaʋanhu;
Nyasha yakaɗururirwa pamiromo yenyu;
Saka Mŋari wakakuropafadzai nokusiŋgaperi.

Fambai noʋumambo bgenyu mucikunda,
Nokuɗa kweɀokwaɗi noʋunyoro nokururama;
Ruʋoko rwenyu rworudyi ŋgarukudzidzisei ɀinotyisa.

Miseʋe yenyu inopinza;
Ʋanhu ʋanokundwa nemi;
Inoɓaya pamŋoyo yaʋaʋeŋgi ʋamambo.

Makaɗa kururama, mukaʋeŋga kusarurama;
Naiɀoɀo Mŋari, Mŋari wenyu, wakakuzodzai
Namafuta okufara kupfuʋura shamŋari dzenyu.

Ucaperekwa kunamambo neŋguʋo dzakarukwa dzinamaʋara;
Mhandara, shamŋari dzake dzinomuteʋera,
Ʋacaiswa kwamuri.

46:
Unogumisa kurwa kuȿikira pakuguma kwenyika;
Unovuna ʋuta, nokuvuna‐vuna pfumo;
Unopisa ŋgoro dzokurwa nomŋoto.

47:
Macinda aʋanhu aʋuŋgana
Pamŋe cete naʋanhu ʋaMŋari waAbrahama;
Nokuti nhoʋo dzapasipose ndedzaMŋari;
Ndiye mukuru‐kuru kwaɀo.

48:
Seɀatakanzwa, ndiɀo ɀatakaʋona
Paguta raJehova wehondo, iro guta raMŋari weɗu;
Mŋari ucarisimbisa nokusiŋgaperi.

Seɀakaita zita renyu, Mŋari,
Ndiɀo ɀakaita ʋo kurumbidzwa kwenyu kuȿikira kumigumo yapasipose;
Ruʋoko rwenyu rworudyi ruzere nokururama.

Cerekedzai ɀakanaka nhare dzaro,
Fambai pakati pedzimba dzaro dzamambo;
Kuti muzoʋudza ʋazukuruʋenyu ʋanoteʋera.

49:
Ʋanofuŋga pamŋoyo paʋo kuti dzimba dzaʋo dzicagara nokusiŋgaperi,
Noʋugaro bgaʋo kuȿikira kumarudziaʋo ose;
Nyika dzaʋo ʋanodzitumidza mazita aʋo.

Ʋakatarirwa Sheori samakwai;
Rufu rucaʋa mufudzi waʋo;
Ʋakarurama ʋacaɓata ʋushe pamsoro paʋo maŋgwanani;
Kunaka kwaʋo kucaŋgoparadzwa neSheori, kuti kurege kuʋa noʋugaro.

50:
Mŋari weɗu unoʋuya, haaŋgarambi anyerere;
Mŋoto unoparadza pamberi pake,
Ƌutu guru rinomukomberedza.

Inzwai ʋanhu ʋaŋgu, ndicataura;
Imi Israeri, ndicakupupurirai:
Ndini Mŋari, iye Mŋari wenyu.

Ɀinhu iɀi wakaɀiita, ndikaramba ndinyerere;
Wakafuŋga kuti ini ndakafanana newe cose;
Asi ndicakuraira, ndiciroŋgedzera ɀinhu iɀi pameso ako.

Munhu, unoɓayira ciɓayiro cokuʋoŋga, unondikudza;
Ʋuye unogadzira nzira yake ɀakanaka
Ndicamuratidza kuponesa kwaMŋari.

53:
Ƃenzi rakati mumŋoyo maro: Mŋari hakuna.
Ʋakaʋora, ʋakaita ɀakaipa ɀinonyaŋgadza;
Hakuna‐unoita ɀakanaka.

Ʋaitya kwaɀo ipapo, pakaŋga pasina‐cinotyisa;
Nokuti Mŋari wakaparadza mafupa aiye wakaŋga akakukomba;
Iwe wakaʋanyadzisa, nokuti Mŋari wakaʋarasha.

55:
Nokuti wakaŋga asi muʋeŋgi wakandishoʋora;
Ipapo ndaigona kutsuŋga;
Wakaŋga asi iye waindiʋeŋga wakaɀikudza kwandiri;
Ipapo ndaimuʋanda.

Rufu ŋgaruʋawire kamŋe‐kamŋe,
Ŋgaʋaɓurukire kuSheori ʋari ʋapenyu;
Nokuti kushata kuri paʋugaro bgaʋo, imo mukati maʋo.

Asi imi Mŋari mucaʋaɓurusira kugomba rokuparadzwa;
Ʋanhu ʋanokarira ropa naʋanonyeŋgera haʋaŋgapedzi hafu yamazuʋa aʋo;
Asi ini ndicaʋimba nemi.

56:
MunaMŋari ndicarumbidza shoko rake;
Ndakaʋimba naMŋari, handiŋgatyi;
Nyama iŋgandiiteiko?

Imi munoʋereŋga madzuŋgairire aŋgu;
Isai misodzi yaŋgu mumudziyo wenyu;
Haizi murugwaro rwenyu here?

57:
Ndinzwirei tsitsi, Mŋari, ndinzwirei tsitsi;
Nokuti mŋeya waŋgu unotizira kwamuri;
Ɀirokwaɀo, ndicatizira kumumvuri wamapapiro enyu,
Kuȿikira njodzi dzapfuʋura.

Ucatumamuɓatsiri ari kuɗeŋga, andiponese,
Kana iye, unoʋaʋarira kundimedza, acindishoʋora;
Mŋari ucatuma tsitsi dzake neɀokwaɗi yake.

Ʋakateyira tsoka dzaŋgu mumbure;
Mŋeya waŋgu wakakotamiswa;
Ʋakacera hunza pamberi paŋgu;
Ʋawira mukati mayo ʋamene.

59:
Nokuti tarirai, ʋanoʋandira mŋeya waŋgu;
Ʋanesimba ʋakaʋuŋgana kuzorwa neni;
Hakuzi nokuɗa kwokuɗarika kwaŋgu kana kweɀiʋi ɀaŋgu, Jehova.

Iyemi Jehova, Mŋari wehondo, Mŋari waIsraeri,
Mukai mushanyire ʋahedeni ʋose;
Musanzwira tsitsi muɗariki upi noupi wakaipa.

Tarirai, ʋanodɀoʋa nemiromo yaʋo;
Minondo iri pamiromo yaʋo;
Nokuti ʋanoti: Ndianiko uŋganzwa?

Musaʋaʋuraya, kuti ʋanhu ʋaŋgu ʋarege kukaŋganwa;
Muʋaparadzire nesimba renyu, muʋawisire pasi,
Ishe nhoʋo yeɗu.

Ʋapedzei nehasha, ʋapedzei, ʋarege kuzoʋa’po;
Ŋgaʋaziʋe kuti Mŋari unoɓata ʋushe pakati paJakobo,
Kuȿikira kumigumo yenyika.

Asi ini ndicaimba ndicireʋa simba renyu;
Ɀirokwaɀo ndicarumbidza tsitsi dzenyu maŋgwanani;
Nokuti makaŋga muri nhare yaŋgu yakakwirira,
Noʋutiziro bgaŋgu pazuʋa rokutambudzika kwaŋgu.

60:
Gireadi ndeyaŋgu Manase ndeyaŋgu;
Efraimi ʋo inhaʋiro yomusoro waŋgu;
Juda ndiyo tȿimbo yaŋgu yoʋushe.

Moabi ndiwo mudziyo waŋgu wokushambidzira;
Pamsoro peEdomi ndi’po pandicakandira shaŋgu yaŋgu;
Iwe Firistia, pururudza nokuɗa kwaŋgu.

62:
Ʋanoŋgoraŋgana kuti ʋamusundire pasi abve paʋukuru bgake;
Ʋanofarira nhema;
Ʋanoropafadza nomuromo waʋo, asi ʋanotuka mumŋoyo maʋo.

Ʋimbai naye ŋguʋa dzose, imi ʋanhu;
Ƌururai mŋoyo yenyu pamberi pake;
Mŋari ndiye ʋutiziro bgeɗu.

Ɀirokwaɀo ʋanhu ʋasiŋgakudzwi mŋeya cete, ʋuye ʋanhu ʋanokudzwa inhema;
Pakuyerwa haʋaremi;
Ʋose pamŋe cete ʋakareruka kupfuʋura mŋeya.

Regai kuʋimba nokumanikidza,
Regai kuɀikudza pamsoro pokupambara;
Kana fuma iciwanda, regai kuinamatira nomŋoyo.

Mŋari wakataura kamŋe cete,
Ndakaɀinzwa kaʋiri;
Kuti simba nderaMŋari;

63:
Mŋari, imi muri Mŋari waŋgu; ndicakutȿakai maŋgwanani;
Mŋeya waŋgu unenyota kwamuri, nyama yaŋgu inokushuʋai,
Panyika yakawoma, inonzwisa nyota, isinemvura.

Asi mambo ucafara munaMŋari;
Mumŋe nomumŋe unopika naye ucafara kwaɀo;
Nokuti muromo waʋanoreʋa nhema ucadziʋirwa.

64:
Ʋanotsuŋgirira pazano rakaipa;
Ʋanoraŋgana kuteya misuŋgo pakaʋanda;
Ʋanoti: Ndianiko uŋgaɀiʋona?

Ʋanofuŋgisisa ɀakaipa;
Ʋanoti: Tapedza kufuŋgisisa zano guru;
Kufuŋga kwomukati kwomumŋe nomumŋe, nomŋoyo, ɀakadzika.

Ʋanhu ʋose ʋacatya;
Ʋacaparidza ɓasa raMŋari,
Ʋacicerekedza ɀakanaka ɀaanoita.

65:
Mukururamakwenyu munotipindura neɀinhu ɀinotyisa,
Imi Mŋari muponesi weɗu;
Imi ciʋimbo camatiʋi ose apasi,
Naʋari kure paguŋgwa;

Munoshanyira pasi, munopaɗiridza,
Munopafumisa kwaɀo;
Rwizi rwaMŋari ruzere nemvura;
Munoʋagadzirira ɀiyo, kana magadzira pasi saiɀoɀo.

Munozadza mihoroŋga yapo kwaɀo;
Munoenzanisa mipanje yapo;
Munopanyoroʋesa nemvura inopfunha;
Munoropafadza ɀinomera ɀapo.

Mafuro akafukidzwa namapoka eɀipfuwo;
Ʋuye mipata ʋo yakafukidzwa neɀiyo;
Ɀinopururudza, ɀiciimba ʋo.

66:
Pasi pose pacanamata kwamuri,
Pacakuimbirai;
Ʋacaimbira zita renyu.

Wakashandura guŋgwa rikaʋa nyika yakawoma;
Ʋakayambuka rwizi netsoka;
Ipapo takafara maari.

Unoɓata ʋushe nokusiŋgaperi nesimba rake;
Meso ake anocerekedza ndudzi;
Ʋanomumukira ŋgaʋarege kuɀikudza.

Makafambisa ʋanhu pamsoro pemisoro yeɗu;
Takapinda nomumŋoto nemvura;
Asi makatiɓuɗisa kunɀimbo ineɀakawanda.

Ndicakuɓayirai ɀipiriso ɀinopiswa ɀeɀakakora,
Neɀinonhuwira ɀamakondobge;
Ndicaɓayira nzombe pamŋe cete nembudzi.

67:
Ndudzi ŋgadzifare, ŋgadziimbe nomufaro;
Nokuti mucatoŋga ʋanhu nokururama,
Mucafambisa ndudzi pasi.

68:
Muʋadziŋge, sokudziŋgwa kwoʋutsi;
Sokunyauka kwenamo pamŋoto,
Saiɀoɀo ʋakaipa ŋgaʋapere pamberi paMŋari.

Imbirai Mŋari, imbirai zita rake nziyo dzokurumbidza;
Mumugadzirire mugwagwa wakanaka, iye unofambaneŋgoro napamarenje;
Zita rake ndiJehova; farai kwaɀo pamberi pake.

Ʋakaŋga ʋari ʋoga, Mŋari unoʋagarisa pamhuri;
Unoɓuɗisira ʋasuŋgwa kumufaro;
Asi ʋanomumukira ʋanogara panyika yakawoma.

Pasi pakabvunda,
Kuɗeŋga‐ɗeŋga kwakaɗonha pamberi paMŋari;
Nairo Sinai rakabvunda pamberi paMŋari, iye Mŋari waIsraeri.

Makakwira kumsoro, mukatapa ʋatapxaʋenyu;
Makagamucira ɀipo pakati paʋanh
Ɀirokwaɀo pakati paʋakakumukirai ʋo, kuti Jehova Mŋari agarenaʋo.

Ipai Mŋari simba;
Ʋukuru bgake ʋuri pamsoro paIsraeri,
Simba rake riri mumakore.

Imi Mŋari munotyisa panɀimbo dzenyu tȿene;
Mŋari waIsraeri ndiye unopa ʋanhuʋake simba noʋushe.
Mŋari ŋgaaʋoŋgwe.

69:
Ʋanondiʋeŋga ndisinemhoȿa ʋazhinji kupfuʋura vudzi romusoro waŋgu;
Aʋo ʋanoɗa kundiparadza ʋanesimba,kunyaŋge ʋacindiʋeŋga ndisinemhoȿa;
Ndakafanira kudzosera ɀandineŋge ndisina‐kutora.

Asi kana ndiri’ni, munyeŋgetero waŋgu uri kwamuri, Ishe, paŋguʋa yakafanira;
Mŋari, netsitsi dzenyu zhinji
Ndipindurei nokuponesa kwenyu kwakatendeka.

Ƃoporodzi remvura rirege kundikunda,
Mvura yakadzika irege kundimedza;
Gomba rirege kuzarira muromo waro pamsoro paŋgu.

Kushoʋora kwakaputsa mŋoyo waŋgu; ndaremerwa kwaɀo;
Ndakatȿaka ʋaŋgandinzwira nyasha, asi kwakaŋga kusinomunhu;
Ndakatȿaka ʋaʋaraidzi, asi handina‐kuwana nomumŋe.

70:
Ʋose ʋanokutȿakai ŋgaʋafarise ʋaʋe nomufaro mamuri;
Ʋanoɗa kuponesa kwenyu ŋgaʋarambe ʋaciti:
Mŋari ŋgaakudzwe!

Asi ini ndiri murombo nomushaiwi;
Kurumidzai muʋuye kwandiri, Mŋari;
Imi muri muɓatsiri waŋgu nomurwiri waŋgu;
Regai kunonoka, Jehova.

71:
Iʋai ɗombo raŋgu mandiŋgagara, kwandiŋgaramba ndicienda;
Makaraira kuti ndiponeswe;
Nokuti ndi’mi ɗombo raŋgu nenhare yaŋgu.

Ndakatsigirwa nemi kubva paciɀaro;
Ndi’mi makandiɓuɗisa paɗumbu ramai ʋaŋgu;
Ndicasikurumbidzai.

Muromo waŋgu ucareʋa kururama kwenyu,
Nokuponesa kwenyu zuʋa rose;
Nokuti handiziʋi kuwanda kwaɀo.

Haiwa, kuȿikira ndakwegura ndacena vudzi, Mŋari regai kundisiya;
Kuȿikira ndaɗudzira simba renyu kurudzirunoʋuya,
Nesimba renyu kunomumŋe nomumŋe unozoʋuya.

Kururama kwenyu ʋo, Mŋari, kuri kumsoro‐soro;
Iyemi makaita ɀinhu ɀikuru,
Mŋari, ndianiko wakafanana nemi?

72:
Iye ucararama, ucapiwa ndarama yeSheba;
Ʋanhu ʋacaramba ʋacimunyeŋgeterera;
Ʋacamuʋoŋga zuʋa rose.

Kucaʋa neɀiyo ɀizhinji pasi pamsoro pamakomo;
Ɀiɓereko ɀaɀo ɀicawuŋga seRebanoni;
Ʋanogara paguta ʋacakura soʋuswa pasi.

Zita rake ricaʋa’po nokusiŋgaperi;
Zita rake ricagara riri’po paŋguʋa yose yokuʋa’po kwezuʋa;
Ʋanhu ʋacaropafadzwa maari;
Ndudzi dzose dzicati: Unomufaro.

Zita rake rinobginya ŋgarirumbidzwe nokusiŋgaperi;
Pasi pose ŋgapazadzwe nokubginya kwenyu.
Ameni, Ameni.

73:
Kana ndirini, kusweɗera pedyo ari ndiɀo ɀinondifadza;
Ishe Mŋari ndakamuita nhare yaŋgu,
Kuti ndiparidze maɓasa enyu ose.

74:
Raŋgarirai ʋuŋgano yenyu yamakateŋga kare,
Yamakadzikinura kuti ruʋe rudzi rwenhaka yenyu;
Gomo reZioni pamakaŋga mugere.

Haticaʋoni ɀiratidzo ɀeɗu;
Hapacino‐muprofita;
Pakati peɗu hapanomunhu unoziʋa kuti ɀicaȿikira rini.

75:
Tinokuʋoŋgai, Mŋari;
Tinoʋoŋga, nokuti zita renyu riri pedyo;
Ʋanhu ʋanoparidza maɓasa enyu anoshamisa.

Nokuti muruʋoko rwaJehova munomukombe, newaini inopupuma;
Uzere neɀakaveŋganiswa, ɀino unoɗurura mauri;
Ɀirokwaɀo, ʋakaipa ʋose ʋenyika ʋacaȿina masese awo, nokuanwa.

77:
Pazuʋa rokutambudzika kwaŋgu ndakatȿaka Ishe;
Ruʋoko rwaŋgu rwakaŋga rwakatambanudzwa ʋusiku, ndisiŋgaregi;
Mŋeya waŋgu wakaramba kunyaradzwa.

Ndinoɀiyeʋudzira kuimba kwaŋgu pakati poʋusiku;
Ndinotaurirana nomŋoyo waŋgu;
Mŋeya waŋgu wakanɀera kwaɀo.

Mvura zhinji yakakuʋonai, Mŋari;
Mvura zhinji yakakuʋonai, ikatya;
Pakadzika pakabvunda.

Makore akaɗurura mvura;
Ƌeŋga rose rakaɓuɗisa inzwi;
Miseʋe yenyu yakafamba‐famba kwose.

Inzwi rokutinhira kwenyu rakaŋga riri mucampupuri;
Mheni dzakavenekera nyika;
Pasi pakabvunda nokuzunuŋguka.

78:
Kuti tariro yaʋo iʋe kunaMŋari,
Ʋarege kukaŋganwa maɓasa aMŋari,
Asi ʋaceŋgete mirairo yake;

Saka Jehova wakanzwa, akatsamŋa;
Mŋoto ukaʋeserwa Jakobo,
Kutsamŋa kukamukira Israeri;

Asi iye, ɀaakaŋga anenyasha huru, wakaʋakaŋganwira kuipakwaʋo, akasaʋaparadza;
Ɀirokwaɀo, kazhinji wakadzora kutsamŋa kwake,
Akasamutsa hasha dzake dzose.

Wakagadzirira kutsamŋa kwake nzira;
Haana‐kubvisa mŋeya waʋo parufu,
Asi wakaisa ʋupenyu bgaʋo kuhosha;

79:
Haiwa Mŋari, ʋahedeni ʋakapinda panhaka yenyu;
Ʋakaȿiɓisa tembere yenyu tȿene;
Jerusarema ʋakariita ɗoŋgo.

Musaraŋgarira kutiroʋa pamsoro peɀakaipa ɀamadziɓaɓa eɗu;
Ŋgoni dzenyu nyoro ŋgadzikurumidze kusoŋgana nesu;
Nokuti taneta kwaɀo.

Naiɀoɀo isu ʋanhu ʋenyu, namakwai amafuro enyu,
Ticakuʋoŋgai nokusiŋgaperi;
Ticaratidza kurumbidzwa kwenyu kumarudzi namarudzi.

80:
Tererai nenzeʋe, Mufudzi waIsraeri,
Iyemi munotuŋgamirira Josefa seɓokareɀipfuwo;
Imi mugere pakati pamakerubi, penyai!

81:
Wakaɀitema munaJosefa kuti ciʋe cipupuriro,
Paŋguʋa yaakandorwa nenyika yeEgipita;
Pandakanzwa rurimi rwandakaŋga ndisiŋgaziʋi.

Iwe wakaɗana pakutambudzika, ndikakurwira;
Ndakakupindura ndiri panoʋanda kutinhira;
Ndakakuidza pamvura zhinji yeMeriba.

Ndini Jehova Mŋari wako,
Wakakuɓuɗisa panyika yeEgipita;
Shamisa muromo wako kwaɀo, ndigouzadza.

82:
Haʋaziʋi, haʋanzwisisi;
Ʋanofamba‐famba murima;
Nheyo dzose dzapasi dzinozunuŋguka.

84:
Nokuti Jehova Mŋari izuʋa nenhoʋo;
Jehova ucapa nyasha nokukudzwa;
Hapanecinhu cakanaka caaŋganyima ʋanofamba nokururama.

85:
Ndicanzwa ɀicataura Mŋari Jehova;
Nokuti ucataura rugare kuʋanhu ʋake, nokuʋatȿene ʋake;
Asi ŋgaʋarege kudzokera ɀe kuʋupenzi.

86:
Riŋgirai kwandiri, mundinzwire ŋgoni;
Ipai muranda wenyu simba renyu,
Muponese mŋanakomana womurandakadzi wenyu.

Ndiratidzei ciratidzomundiitire ɀakanaka;
Kuti ʋanondiʋeŋga ʋaɀiʋone, ʋanyadziswe;
Nokuti imi Jehova, makandiɓatsira nokundinyaradza.

87:
Rahabi neBabironi ndicati ʋari pakati paʋanondiziʋa;
Tarirai, Firistia, neTire, neEtiopia;
Munhu uyu wakaɀarirwa’ko.

88:
Makaisa ʋazikani ʋaŋgu kure neni;
Makandiita cinhu cinonyaŋgadza kwaʋari;
Ndakapfigirwa, handigoni kuɓuɗa.

Ziso raŋgu ropera nemhaka yokutambudzika;
Ndakaɗana kwamuri, Jehova, zuʋa rimŋe nerimŋe,
Ndakatambanudzira maʋoko aŋgu kwamuri.

89:
Paŋguʋa iyo makataura naʋatsene ʋenyu pakuɀiratidza kwenyu,
Mukati: Ndakaɓatsira mhare;
Ndakasimudza mumŋe wakasanaŋgurwa pakati paʋanhu.

90:
Kunaka kwaJehova Mŋari weɗu ŋgakuʋe pamsoro peɗu;
Mutisimbisire ɓasa ramaʋoko eɗu;
Ɀirokwaɀo, ɓasa ramaʋoko eɗu murisimbise.

91:
Iye ucakufukidza nemhineŋga yake,
Ucatizira pasi pamapapiro ake;
Ɀokwaɗi yake inhoʋo huru neɗuku.

Kurutiʋi rwako kucawa ʋanegumi ramazana,
Nezana ramazana paruʋoko rwako rworudyi;
Asi haɀiŋgasweɗeri kwauri.

Iye ucaɗana kwandiri, ndicamupindura;
Ini ndicaʋa naye pakutambudzika;
Ndicamurwira, nokumukudza.

92:
Kana ʋakaipa ʋacimera soʋuswa,
Ʋuye kana ʋaiti ʋose ʋeɀakaipa ʋacikura;
Ɀinoitwa kuti ʋaparadzwe nokusiŋgaperi.

Nokuti tarirai; Jehova, ʋaʋeŋgi ʋenyu,
Nokuti tarirai, Jehova, ʋaʋeŋgi ʋenyu ʋacaparara;
Ʋaiti ʋose ʋeɀakaipa ʋacaparadzirwa.

93:
Jehova unoɓata ʋushe; wakafuka ʋumambo;
Jehova wakafuka simba, wakaɀisuŋga ciʋuno naro;
Nyika ʋo yakateyiwa, haiŋgazunuŋguswi.

Jehova, nzizi dzakanzwisa,
Nzizi dzakanzwisa manzwi adzo;
Nzizi dzinonzwisa kutinhira kwadzo.

Ɀipupuriro ɀenyu ndeɀamaɀokwaɗi kwaɀo;
Ʋutȿene ʋunofanira imba yenyu,
Jehova, nokusiŋgaperi.

94:
Ucadzosera pamsoro paʋo kutadza kwaʋo,
Ucaʋaparadza pakati pokuipa kwaʋo;
Jehova Mŋari weɗu ucaʋaparadza.

95:
Ndakaŋga ndineshuŋgu pamsoro porudzi urwo makore makumi manna,
Ndikati: Ndiʋanhu ʋakarashika pamŋoyo yaʋo,
Haʋana‐kuziʋa nzira dzaŋgu;

96:
Itiyi pakati paʋahedeni: Jehova ndiye unoɓata ʋushe;
Nyika ʋo yakasimbiswa, kuti irege kuzunuŋguswa;
Iye ucatoŋga ʋanhu ɀakarurama.

PamberipaJehova, nokuti unoʋuya;
Nokuti unoʋuya kuzotoŋga pasi;
Ucatoŋga nyika ɀakarurama,
Nendudzi nokutendeka kwake.

97:
Ʋose, ʋanoshumira mifananidzo yakaʋeziwa, ʋanonyadziswa,
Iʋo ʋanoɀirumbidza pamsoro peɀifananidzo;
Namatai kwaari, imi ʋamŋari ʋose.

Zioni rakanzwa ndokufara,
Naʋakunda ʋaJuda ʋakafara kwaɀo;
Nokuɗa kweɀamakatoŋga, imi Jehova.

Ʋeŋgai ɀakaipa, imi munoɗa Jehova;
Iye unoceŋgeta mŋeya yaʋatȿene ʋake;
Unoʋarwira paruʋoko rwowakaipa.

98:
Imbirai Jehova rwiyo rutȿa;
Nokuti wakaita ɀinhu ɀinoshamisa;
Canza cake corudyi, noruʋoko rwake rutȿene, ɀakamukundisa.

99:
Simba ramambo rinoɗa ʋo kururamisa;
Imi munosimbisa kururama,
Munotoŋga muciruramisa pakati paJakobo.

Kudzai Jehova Mŋari weɗu,
Munamate pacitsiko cetsoka dzake;
Ndiye Mutȿene.

Mosesi naAroni pakati paʋaprista ʋake,
NaSamueri pakati paʋanoɗana zita rake;
Ʋakaɗana kunaJehova, iye akaʋapindura.

Makaʋapindura, Jehova Mŋari weɗu;
Maiʋa Mŋari waiʋakaŋganwira,
Kunyaŋge makatsiʋa ɀaʋaiita.

Kudzai Jehova Mŋari weɗu,
Namatai pagomo rake dɀene;
Nokuti Jehova Mŋari weɗu ndiye Mutȿene.

100:
Ziʋai kuti Jehova ndiye Mŋari;
Ndiye wakatiita, tiriʋanhu ʋake;
Tiri ʋanhu ʋake, namakwai anofudzwa naye.

Pindai pamasuʋo ake muciʋoŋga,
Napaʋazhe dzake mucirumbidza;
Cimuʋoŋgai, murumbidze zita rake.

101:
Ndicaita ɀose nokuŋgwara panzira yakarurama;
Haiwa, mucaʋuya kwandiri riniko?
Ndicafamba mumba maŋgu nomŋoyo wakarurama.

Handiŋgaʋaʋariri cinhu cakaipa;
Ndinoʋeŋga ɀinoitwa naʋanotsauka;
Haɀiŋgandinamatiri.

102:
Regai kundiʋanzira ciso cenyu pazuʋa rokutambudzika kwaŋgu;
Rerekerai nzeʋe yenyu kwandiri;
Pazuʋa rokuɗana kwaŋgu kurumidzai kundipindura.

Ɀicaparara iɀo, asi imi mucagara muri’po;
Ɀirokwaɀo, iɀoɀo ɀose ɀicasakara seŋguʋo;
Mucaɀishandura secisimiro, ɀikashanduka;

103:
Rumbidzai Jehova, imi ʋatumŋa ʋake;
Imi mhare dzinesimba, munoita ɀaakataura,
Muciterera inzwi reshoko rake.

Rumbidzai Jehova, imi maɓasa ake ose,
Panɀimbo dzose dzoʋumambo bgake;
Rumbidza Jehova, mŋeya waŋgu!

104:
Rumbidza Jehova, mŋeya waŋgu!
Jehova Mŋari waŋgu, muri mukuru kwaɀo;
Makafukidzwa nokukudzwa noʋumambo.

Ndiye unoteya matanda edzimba dzake mumvura;
Unoita makore ŋgoro yake;
Unofamba pamsoro pamapapiro emhepo;

Unomeresa ʋuswa bgeɀipfuwo,
Nemiriʋo, inoɓatsira ʋanhu;
Kuti aɓuɗise ɀokudya pasi;

Haiwa Jehova, maɓasa enyu mazhinji sei!
Makaaita ose nenjere;
Pasi pazere nefuma yenyu.

Munoʋanza ciso cenyu, iɀo ndokuvunduswa;
Munoɀitorera mŋeya waɀo, iɀo ndokufa,
Ɀicidzokera kuguruʋa raɀo.

106:
Hareruya.
Ʋoŋgai Jehova, nokuti wakanaka;
Nokuti ŋgoni dzake dzinogara nokusiŋgaperi.

Madziɓaɓa eɗu haana‐kunzwisisa ɀishamiso ɀenyu paEgipita;
Haana‐kuraŋgarira ŋgoni dzenyu zhinji;
Asi ʋakakumukirai paguŋgwa, ipo paGuŋgwa Dɀuku.

Saka wakati: Ndinoɗa kuʋaparadza;
Ƌai Mosesi musanaŋgurwa wake asina‐kumira pamberi pake ipo pakaputsika,
Kuti adzore kutsamŋa kwake, arege kuʋaparadza.

Ʋakateʋura ropa risinemhoȿa, iro ropa raʋanakomana ʋaʋo naʋanasikana ʋaʋo,
Ʋakaʋaɓayira ɀifananidzo ɀeKanani;
Nyika ikaȿiɓiswa neropa.

108:
Gireadi ndeyaŋgu naManase ndeyaŋgu;
Efraimi ʋo inhaʋiro yomusoro waŋgu;
Juda ndiyo tȿimbo yaŋgu yoʋushe.

Moabi ndiwo mudziyo waŋgu wokushambidzira;
Pamsoro peEdomi ndi’po pandicakandira shaŋgu yaŋgu;
Ndicapururudza nokuɗa kwaFiristia.

110:
Iye ucatoŋga pakati paʋahedeni,
Ucazadzanyika neɀitunha;
Ucaparadza misoro panyika zhinji.

111:
Wakatumira ʋanhu ʋake rudzikinuro;
Wakaraira suŋgano yake nokusiŋgaperi;
Zita rake idɀene rinotyisa.

Kutya Jehova ndiko kutaŋga kwoʋucenjeri;
Ʋose ʋanoɀiita ʋanomuraŋgariro wakanaka;
Kurumbidzwa kwake kunogara nokusiŋgaperi.

112:
Wakaparadzira, akapa ʋashaiwi;
Kururama kwake kunogara nokusiŋgaperi;
Runyaŋga rwake rucakwiridzwa nokukudzwa.

Wakaipa ucaɀiʋona, ndokufa neshuŋgu;
Ucageda‐geɗa meno ake, ndokunyauka;
Kuɗa kwowakaipa kucaparara.

115:
Ɀinamaʋoko, asi haɀiɓati;
Namakumbo ɀinawo, asi haɀifambi;
Haɀitauri napahuro paɀo.

Jehova wakatiraŋgarira; iye ucatiropafadza;
Ucaropafadza imba yaIsraeri;
Ucaropafadza imba yaAroni.

116:
Misuŋgo yorufu yakandikomba,
Kurwadziwa kweSheori kwakandiɓata;
Ndakawana kutambudzika nokucema.

Haiwa Jehova, ɀirokwaɀo ndiri muranda wenyu;
Ndiri muranda wenyu, mŋanakomana womurandakadzi wenyu;
Makasunuŋgura misuŋgo yaŋgu.

117:
Nokuti ŋgoni dzake kwatiri ihuru;
Kutendeka kwaJehova kunogara nokusiŋgaperi.
Hareruya!

126:
Paŋguʋa iyo muromo weɗu wakaŋga uzere nokuseka,
Norurimi rweɗu nokuimba;
Ipapo pakati paʋahedeni ʋakati:
Jehova wakaʋaitira ɀinhu ɀikuru;

127:
Haɀinamaturo kuti mumuke maŋgwanani nokunonoka kundoʋata,
Nokudya ɀokudya ɀamakatamburira;
Nokuti unopa ʋaɗikanwa ʋake iɀoɀo ʋaʋete.

Unomufaro iye murume unegoɓa rizere naʋo;
Haʋaŋganyadziswi,
Kana ʋacitaurirana naʋaʋeŋgi ʋaʋo pasuʋo.

129:
Naʋanopfuʋura haʋaŋgati:
Jehova ŋgaakuropafadzei;
Tinokuropafadzai nezita raJehova.

130:
Ishe inzwai inzwi raŋgu;
Nzeʋe dzenyu ŋgadziterere
Inzwi rokukumbira kwaŋgu.

Mŋeya waŋguunorindira Ishe,
Kupfuʋura ʋarindiʋanorindira ruŋgwanani;
Ɀirokwaɀo, kupfuʋura ʋarindiʋanorindira ruŋgwanani.

Imi Israeri, tarirai kunaJehova;
Nokuti kunaJehova kuneŋgoni,
Ʋuye kwaari kunokudzikinurwa kukuru.

131:
Jehova, mŋoyo waŋgu hauɀikudzi, meso aŋgu haanamanyawi;
Handinehanya neɀinhu ɀikuru‐kuru,
Kana neɀinhu ɀinondikurira.

Ɀirokwaɀo ndakaʋaraidza mŋeya waŋgu nokuunyaradza;
Somŋana wakarumurwa uri panamai ʋake,
Mŋeya waŋgu wakaita kwandiri somŋana wakarumurwa.

132:
Jehova wakapika kunaDavidi;
Haaŋgashanduki paɀiri,aciti:
Ɀiɓereko ɀomuʋiri wako ndiɀo ɀandicaisa pacigaro cako coʋushe.

133:
Ɀakafanana namafuta anokosha ari pamusoro,
Anoyerera pandebvu,
Idzo ndebvu dzaAroni;
Anoɓurukira kuȿikira pamipendero yeŋguʋo dzake;

135:
Hareruya!
Rumbidzai zita raJehova;
Murumbidzei, imi ʋaranda ʋaJehova;

Unokwidza makore pamigumo yapasi;
Unoita mhenikuʋuyisa mvura;
Unoɓuɗisa mhepo panoʋigwa fuma yake.

Sihoni mambo waʋaAmori,
NaOgi mambo weBashani,
Noʋushe bgose bgeKanani;

137:
Iwe mukunda weBabironi, iwe wobva woparadzwa;
Munhu uyo ucaʋa nomufaro, ucakutsiʋira
Seɀawakatiitira iwe.

138:
Ndicanamatandakatarira kutembere yenyu tȿene,
Nokuʋoŋga zita renyu nokuɗa kwoʋunyoro bgenyu nokutendeka kwenyu;
Nokuti makakurisa shoko renyu kupfuʋura zita renyu rose.

Kana ndicifamba pakati penhamo, imi mucandiponesa;
Mucatambanudza ruʋoko rwenyu kudziʋisa kutsamŋa kwaʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu,
Ruʋoko rwenyu rworudyi rucandiponesa.

Jehova ucandikwanisiraɀinhu ɀaŋgu;
Ŋgoni dzenyu, Jehova, dzinogara nokusiŋgaperi;
Musarega maɓasa amaʋoko enyu.

139:
Kunyaŋge rima hariŋgandiʋanzi kwamuri,
Asi ʋusiku ʋunopenya samasikati;
Rima neciedza ɀakafanana.

Ndicakuʋoŋgai; nokuti ndakaitwa nomutoʋo unotyisa unoshamisa;
Maɓasa enyu anoshamisa;
Mŋeya waŋgu unoɀiziʋa kwaɀo.

140:
Ndiceŋgetei, Jehova, pamaʋoko owakaipa;
Ndiceŋgetei pamunhu unomanikidza;
Ʋanofuŋga mano okugumbusa tsoka dzaŋgu.

Ʋanoɀikudza ʋakandiʋanzira musuŋgo namaɓote;
Ʋakadzika mumbure parutiʋi rwenzira:
Ʋakanditeyera rugombe.

Mazimbe omŋoto, anopfuta, ŋgaawire pamsoro paʋo;
Ŋgaʋakandirwe mumŋoto;
Nomumakomba akadzika, kuti ʋarege kumuka ɀe.

141:
Wakarurama ŋgaandiroʋe netsitsi;
Ŋgaandituke, aʋe mafuta pamusorowaŋgu;
Musoro waŋgu hauŋgaarambi;
Nokuti ndicaramba ndicinyeŋgetera pamsoro pokuipa kwaʋo.

142:
Ndakaɗanidzira kwamuri, Jehova;
Ndakati: Ndimi ʋutiziro bgaŋgu,
Nomugoʋe waŋgu panyika yaʋapenyu.

Ƃuɗisai mŋeya waŋgu patoroŋgo, kuti ndiʋoŋge zita renyu;
Ʋakarurama ʋacandipoteredza;
Nokuti mucandiitira ɀakanaka kwaɀo.

143:
Nokuti muʋeŋgi wakatambudza mŋeya waŋgu;
Wakatsikirira ʋupenyu bgaŋgu pasi;
Wakandigarisa panɀimbo dzinerima, saʋanhu ʋakaŋguʋa ʋafa.

Ndinoraŋgarira mazuʋa akare;
Ndinofuŋgisisa ɀose ɀamakaita;
Ndinofuŋga ɓasa ramaʋoko enyu.

Kurumidzai kundipindura, Jehova; mŋeya waŋgu waziya;
Regai kundiʋanzira ciso cenyu;
Ndigosaʋa saʋanoɓurukira kugomba.

Ndinzwisei ʋunyoro bgenyu maŋgwanani;
Nokuti ndinoʋimba nemi;
Ndiziʋisei nzira yandinofanira kufamba nayo;
Nokuti ndinosimudzira mŋeya waŋgu kwamuri.

Pedzai ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu noʋunyoro bgenyu,
Muparadze ʋose ʋanomanikidza mŋeya waŋgu;
Nokuti ndiri muranda wenyu.

144:
Ŋgaarumbidzwe Jehova, ɗombo raŋgu,
Unodzidzisa maʋoko aŋgu kurwa,
Neminwe yaŋgu kufura;

Ʋunyoro bgaŋgu, nenhare yaŋgu,
Shoŋgwe yaŋgu yakakwirira, nomurwiri waŋgu;
Nhoʋo yaŋgu, ʋuye iye wandinoʋimba naye;
Unoisa ʋanhu ʋaŋgu pasi paŋgu.

Tambunudzai ruʋoko rwenyu muri kumsoro;
Ndisunuŋgurei, mundirwire pamvura zhinji,
Naparuʋoko rwaʋatorwa;

Nzombe dzeɗu dzicatakudzwa ɀizhinji;
Hatiŋgaputsirwimadziro, kana kuɓuɗakundorwa,
Hakuŋgaʋi nemhere inoridzwa panzira dzomumusha meɗu;

145:
Ndicakukudzai kwaɀo,
Mŋari waŋgu, imi Mambo;
Ndicarumbidza zita renyu nokusiŋgaperi‐peri.

146:
Iye, wakaita kuɗeŋga napasi,
Neguŋgwa, neɀose ɀiri mukati maɀo;
Iye, unoramba akatendeka nokusiŋgaperi;

Unoruramisira ʋanomanikidzwa;
Unopa ʋanenzara ɀokudya;
Jehova unosunuŋgura ʋasuŋgwa;

Jehova unosinudzameso amapofu;
Jehova unosimudza ʋakakotamiswa pasi;
Jehova unoɗa ʋakarurama;

Jehova unoceŋgeta ʋatorwa;
Jehova unotsigira nherera necirikadzi;
Asi nzira yaʋakaipa unoipesanisa.

147:
Hareruya!
Nokuti ɀakanaka kuti Mŋari weɗu aimbirwe nziyo dzokurumbidza;
Ɀinofadza, ʋuye kurumbidza kwakafanira.

Haana‐kutoŋgoitira rumŋe rudzi saiɀoɀo;
Kana ɀiri ɀaakatoŋga, haʋanakuɀiziʋa.
Hareruya!

148:
Hareruya!
Rumbidzai Jehova,imi muri kuɗeŋga;
Murumbidzei panɀimbo dzokumsoro.

Ŋgaʋarumbidze zita raJehova;
Nokuti zita rake roga rakakurumbira;
Ʋumambo bgake ʋuri kumsoro kwapasi nokuɗeŋga.

149:
Kuti ʋaʋaitire ɀaʋakatoŋgerwa ɀakanyorwa;
Ʋatȿene ʋake ʋose ʋacakudzwa naiɀoɀi.
Hareruya!

150:
Hareruya!
Rumbidzai Jehova panɀimbo yake tȿene;
Murumbidzei muɗeŋgarakaitwa nesimba rake,

1:
Kana ʋaciti: Hendei tose,
Ŋgatirindire ropa;
Ŋgatiʋandire ʋasinemhoȿakunyaŋge pasinemhaka.

Ʋunoɗana panɀimbo panoʋuŋgana ʋazhinji;
Paʋanopinda pamasuʋo,
Paguta, ndi’po paʋunotaura mashoko abgo,ʋuciti:

Dzokaikana mucinzwa kuraira kwaŋgu,
Tarirai ndicaɗurura mŋeya waŋgu pamsoro penyu;
Ndicakuziʋisai mashoko aŋgu.

Kana kutya kwenyu kuciȿika seɗutu guru,
Nenhamo yenyu iciȿika secampupuri;
Kana kutambudzika nokuɗumbirwa ɀicikuwirai.

3:
Ruɗo neɀokwaɗi ŋgaɀirege kukusiya;
Uɀisuŋgire pamutsipa wako;
Uɀinyore pahwendefa romŋoyo wako;

Usati kunowokwako: Enda, ugodzoka ɀe,
Maŋgwana ndicakupa;
Kana uciŋge unaɀo’po.

4:
Iʋoɓaɓa ʋakandidzidzisa, ʋakati kwandiri:
Mŋoyo wako ŋgaunatso‐ɓata mashoko aŋgu;
Ceŋgeta mirairo yaŋgu, urarame.

5:
Sehadzi yenondo yakanaka, nehadzi yeŋgururu inofadza;
Mazamu ake ŋgaakufadze ŋguʋa dzose;
Ugare ucigutiswa noruɗo rwake.

6:
Kana ucifamba, ɀicakutuŋgamirira;
Kana uciʋata pasi, ɀicakurinda;
Kana womuka, ɀicataurirana newe.

7:
Ndikatarira pakati paʋasinamano,
Ndikaʋona pakati pamajaya
Rimŋe jaya rakashaiwa njere;

Unomuteʋera pakarepo,
Senzombe inoenda kwainondoɓayiwa,
Kana seɓenzi rakasuŋgwa rinoenda kundoraŋgwa;

Kuȿikira museʋe waɓaya ciropa cake;
Seshiri inokurumidzira kurugombe,
Asiŋgaziʋi kuti ɀinoʋiŋga ʋupenyu bgake.

8:
Kutya Jehova ndiko kuʋeŋga ɀakaipa;
Kuɀikudza namanyawi nenzira yakaipa,
Nomuromo unonyeŋgedzera, ndinoɀiʋeŋga.

Paŋguʋa yaakaitira guŋgwa miganho yaro,
Kuti mvura irege kuɗarika murairo wake,
Pakutara kwake nheyo dzapasi;

Neŋguʋa iyo ndaiʋa naye, ndiri mhizha;
Ndai mufadza zuʋa rimŋene rimŋe,
Ndicitamba pamberi pake ŋguʋa dzose,

9:
Bgakaɓaya ɀipfuwo ɀabgo;
Bgakaveŋganisa waini yabgo;
Bgakagadzira ʋo tafura yabgo.

10:
Ɀireʋo ɀaSoromoni.
Mŋanakomana, wakacenjera, unofadza ɓaɓa;
Asi mŋanakomana ɓenzi unoshuwisa mai ʋake.

15:
Asi muganho wecirikadzi unousimbisa.
Mano akashata anonyaŋgadza Jehova;
Asi mashoko anofadza akacena.

19:
Hama dzose dzomurombo dzinomuʋeŋga;
Ɀikuru shamŋari dzake dzinoparadzana naye!
Unoʋateʋerera namashoko, asi ʋaenda!

Kutya Jehovakunoisa kuʋupenyu;
Unako, ucaʋata ɀakanaka,
Haaŋgaʋiŋgiwi neɀakaipa.

23:
Nokuti seɀaanofuŋga mumŋoyo make, ndoɀaakaita;
Unoti kwauri: Cidya, cinwa;
Asi mŋoyo wake haunehanya newe.

Ucati: Ʋakandiroʋa, asi handinakurwadziwa;
Ʋakandiroʋa, asi handina‐kuɀinzwa;
Ndicapepuka riniko? Ipapo ndicandoitȿaka ɀe.

24:
Ucaʋona kuti ndiɀo ɀicaita ʋucenjeri kumŋeya wako;
Kana waʋuwana, muɓairo ucaʋa’po,
Neɀawakatarira haɀiŋgaparadzwi.

Gadzira ɓasa rako kunze,
Uɀigadzirire iro pamunda;
Pashure ugoʋaka imba yako.

Tarirai, wakaŋga waŋgomera minzwa cete;
Munda wose wakaŋga wakafukidzwa norukato,
Noruȿiŋgo rwawo rwamabge rwakaŋga rwakoromoka.

25:
Usakurumidza kundoita nharo;
Nokuti ucazoɗini pashure,
Kana wokwako akunyadzisa?

Nhume yakatendeka yakafanana kunaʋanoituma
Nokutonhorera kwecando paŋguʋa yokuceka;
Nokuti inoponesa mŋeya yaʋatenzi ʋayo.

27:
Usasiya shamŋari yako neshamŋari yaɓaɓa ʋako;
Usaenda kumba kwomunuŋuna wako nezuʋa renhamo yako;
Wokwako, uri pedyo, unopfuʋura munuŋuna uri kure.

28:
Aninani unorashisa ʋakarurama ʋafambe nenzira yakaipa,
Ucawira amene mugomba rake;
Asi ʋakarurama ʋacagara nhaka yeɀakanaka.

30:
Bvisai kure neni ɀisina‐kutendeka nenhema;
Regai kundipa ʋurombo kana fuma;
Mundigutse neɀokudya ɀakandifanira;

Sheori; neciɀaro cisiŋgaɓereki;
Pasi pasiŋgaguti mvura;
Nomŋoto, usiŋgati: Ɀariŋgana!

Kufamba kwegondo muɗeŋga;
Kufamba kwenyoka paruware;
Kufamba kwecikepe pakati peguŋgwa;
Nokufamba kwomurume nomusikana.

Ndiɀo ɀakaita kufamba kwomukadzi woʋupombge;
Unodya, ndokupisika muromo wake,
Aciti: Handina‐kuita cinhu cakaipa.

1:
Ɀizoro ɀako ɀinonhuwira ɀakanaka;
Zita rako rakaita samafuta akaɗururwa;
Saka mhandara dzinokuɗa.

Ndikweʋerekwauri; ticakuteʋera ticimhanya;
Mambo wakandiisa mudzimba dzake dzomukati;
Ticafara nokukufarira ɀikuru iwe;
Ticarumbidza ruɗo rwako kupfuʋura waini;
Ɀakarurama ɀaʋakakuɗa.

Tarira, wakanaka, shamŋari yaŋgu;
Tarira, wakanaka;
Meso ako akafanana neenjiʋa.

Tarira, wakanaka, muɗiwa waŋgu,
ɀirokwaɀo, unofadza;
Ʋuʋato bgeɗu ndi’po paɓumhudza.

2:
Muɗiwa waŋgu wakafanana nemharapara kana nomŋana wenondo;
Tarirai, womira seri kworuȿiŋgo rweɗu;
Unotarira napamawindi;
Unoɗoŋgorera napaɀitanda ɀamawindi.

Maruʋa oʋonekwa panyika;
Ŋguʋa yokurira kweshiri yaȿika,
Nenzwi renjiʋa rinonzwika panyika yeɗu.

Muʋonde woibvisa maʋonde awo mambishi,
Ʋuye mizambiriŋga yotuŋga maruʋa;
Yoɓuɗisa kunhuwira kwawo;
Simuka, shamŋari yaŋgu, wakanaka waŋgu, ʋuya!

Iwe njiʋa yaŋgu, uri mumikaha yeɗombo,
Pakadzitika pamawere;
Ndiʋone ciso cako,
Ndinzwe inzwi rako;
Nokuti inzwi rako rakanaka, ciso cako cakanaka.

Tiɓatirei makaʋa, makaʋa maɗuku,
Anotadzira minda yemizambiriŋga;
Nokuti minda yeɗu yemizambiriŋga yotuŋga maruʋa.

3:
Ʋusiku, ndiri panhoʋo dzaŋgu,
Ndakamutȿaka unoɗikanwa nomŋeya waŋgu;
Ndakamutȿaka, asi handina‐kumuwana.

Ndikati: Ndicasimuka ɀino, ndifambe‐fambe neguta;
Panzira dzomumusha, napamaɗare
Ndi’po pandicatȿaka unoɗikanwa nomŋeya waŋgu;
Ndikamutȿaka, asi handina‐kumuwana.

Ʋarindi, ʋanofamba‐famba neguta,
ʋakandiwana;
Ndikati kwaʋari: Matoŋgoʋona unoɗikanwa nomŋeya waŋgu here?

Tarirai, ndico cigaro caSoromoni cinotakurwa;
Mhare dzinamakumi matanhatu dzakacikomberedza,
Ʋanobva pamhare dzaʋaIsraeri.

4:
Miromo yako yakafanana norwonzi rwakatȿuka;
Kutaura kwako kwakanaka;
Ɀaʋoʋo ɀako ɀakafanana neɓande reɗamba
Pakutarira kwako pakati pecifukidzo cako.

Wanditorera mŋoyo waŋgu, hanɀadzi yaŋgu, mŋeŋgawaŋgu;
Wanditorera mŋoyo waŋgu nokunditarira kamŋe nameso ako,
Necishoŋgo cimŋe comutsipa wako.

Miromo yako, mŋeŋgawaŋgu,
inoɗonha muȿi woʋuci;
Ʋuci nomukaka ɀiri pasi porurimi rwako;
Kunhuwira kweŋguʋo dzako kwakafanana nokunhuwira kweRebanoni.

Mataʋi ako munda wamatamba,
uneɀiɓereko ɀakaiȿo‐naka;
Maruʋa ehena nenardo,

Nardo nesafroni,
Karmusi nekinamuni, nemiti yose inonhuwira;
Mura negaʋakaʋa, neɀose ɀinoiȿonhuwira.

Muka, iwe mhepo yokumsoro;
ʋuya, iwe mhepo yezasi;
Furidzira pamunda waŋgu, kuti ɀinonhuwira ɀawo ɀiɓuɗire kunze.
Muɗiwa waŋgu ŋgaapinde mumunda make,
Ŋgaadye ɀiɓereko ɀake ɀakaiȿo‐naka.

5:
Ndapinda mumunda maŋgu, hanɀadzi yaŋgu, mŋeŋgawaŋgu;
Ndaʋuŋganidza mura yaŋgu neɀinonhuwira ɀaŋgu;
Ndadya muȿi woʋuci bgaŋgu noʋuci bgaŋgu;
Ndanwa waini yaŋgu nomukaka waŋgu.
Idyai, shamŋaridzaŋgu;
Inwai, ɀirokwaɀo, inwai ɀikuru,
ʋaɗiwaʋaŋgu.

Ndakaŋga ndiʋete, asi mŋoyo waŋgu wakaŋga wakaȿinura;
Inzwi romuɗiwa waŋgu, unogogodza,aciti:
Ndizarurire, hanɀadzi yaŋgu, muɗiwa waŋgu, njiʋa yaŋgu, wakakwana waŋgu;
Nokuti musoro waŋgu uzere neɗoʋa,
Vudzi raŋgu namaɗonhedza oʋusiku.

Ndakazarurira muɗiwa waŋgu;
Asi muɗiwa waŋgu wakaŋga atendeʋuka, aenda.
Mŋeya waŋgu wakaŋga watorwa pakutaura kwake;
Ndakamutȿaka, asi handina‐kumuwana;
Ndikamuɗana, asi haana‐kundipindura.

Ʋarindi, ʋanofamba‐famba neguta,
ʋakandiwana;
Ʋakandiroʋa, ʋakandikuʋadza;
Ʋatariri ʋamaȿiŋgo ʋakanditorera jasi raŋgu.

Matama ake akaita sendima yemiti inonhuwira,
Samatutu emiriʋo inonaka;
Miromo yake yakaita samaruʋa anoɗonha mura inoyerera.

6:
Njiʋa yaŋgu, wakakwana waŋgu,
ndiye mumŋe oga;
Ndiye mŋana mumŋe woga wamai ʋake;
Ndiye musanaŋgurwa wowakamuɓereka;
Ʋakunda ʋakamuʋona, ʋakati wakaropafadzwa;
Naʋahosi naʋaroŋgo, ʋakamurumbidza.

7:
Mutsipa wako wakaita seshoŋgwe yorunyaŋga rwenzou;
Meso ako samakuʋi paHeshboni,
Pasuʋo reBat‐rabimi;
Mhino dzako dzakafanana neshoŋgwe yeRebanoni
Yakatarisana neDamasko.

Musoro wako pamsoro pako wakafanana neKarmeri;
Nevudzi romusoro wako nomuceka mutȿuku;
Mambo wakasuŋgwa nevudzi rakapetana.

Ŋgatifumire kuminda yemizambiriŋga;
Tindoʋona kana muzambiriŋga watuŋga,
Kana maruʋa akura,
Kana matamba atuŋga maruʋa;
Ndipapo pandicakupa ruɗo rwaŋgu.

Madudayi anoɓuɗisa kunhuwira;
Pamikoʋa yeɗu paneɀinonaka ɀamarudzi ose, ɀitȿa neɀisharu,
Ɀandakakuceŋgetera, iwe muɗiwa waŋgu.

8:
Ndishoŋge secisimbiso pamŋoyo pako,
Secisimbiso paruʋoko rwako;
Nokuti ruɗo runesimba sorufu;
Goɗo rinokuʋadza seSheori;
Kupisa kwaro ndiko kupisa kwomŋoto,
Muraɀo caiwo waJehova.

Mvura zhinji haigoni kudzima ruɗo;
Nzizi hadziŋgaruɓitirisi;
Kunyaŋge munhu akapa fuma yose yeimba yake kuti awane ruɗo,
Uŋgaɀidzwa cose.

Soromoni wakaŋga anomunda wemizambiriŋga paBaari‐hamoni;
Wakaisa munda uyo kuʋatariri;
Mumŋe nomumŋe waifanira kumuʋigira masirveri anegumi ramazana pamsoro peɀiɓereko ɀawo.

Iwe, unogara muminda,
Shamŋaridzako dzinoterera inzwi rako;
Nditendere ini ndirinzwe ʋo.

38:
Ʋugaro bgaŋgu bgaputswa, bgabviswa kwandiri setente romufudzi;
Ndapeta ʋupenyu bgaŋgu, somuruki; ucandigura pacirukiso;
Mucandigumisa kubvira maŋgwanani kuȿikira maɗekwana.

Ndakarira senyeŋganyeŋga kana kondo;
Ndakacema senjiʋa; meso aŋgu akapera nokutarira kumsoro;
Haiwa Jehova, ndakamanikidzwa, iʋai mumiriri waŋgu imi.

Ishe, ʋanhu ʋanorarama neɀinhu iɀoɀi;
Ʋupenyu bgose bgomŋeya waŋgu ʋuri maɀiri;
Naiɀoɀo ndiporesei, mundiraramise.

Tarirai, kutambudzika kwaŋgu kukuru kwakazondiʋigira rugare;
Asi makarwira mŋeya waŋgu noruɗo pagomba rokuparadzwa;
Nokuti makarashira ɀiʋi ɀaŋgu ɀose shure kwenyu.

Jehova wakaɀigadzira kundiponesa;
Naiɀoɀo ticaimba nziyo dzaŋgu nemiteŋgeranwa
Mazuʋa ose oʋupenyu bgeɗu mumba maJehova.

1:
Rinocema ɀikuru ʋusiku, misodzi yaro iri pamatama aro;
Pakati paʋaɗiwa ʋaro ʋose rinoshaiwa muʋaraidzi,
Shamŋari dzaro dzose dzarinyeŋgera, dzashanduka ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaro.

Juda ʋaenda kuʋutorwa nokuɗa kwokutambudzika, nokuɗa kwokuɓatiswa ɀikuru;
Ʋanogara pakati pamarudzi,asi haʋawani zororo,
Ʋose ʋaidziŋgana naʋo ʋakaʋaɓata pakamanikana.

Ʋadziʋisi ʋaro ndiʋo ʋaʋa ʋakuru, ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaro ʋanofara;
Nokuti Jehova wakaritambudza nemhaka yokuɗarika kwaro kuzhinji;
Ʋana ʋaro ʋaɗuku ʋakaenda kuʋutorwa pamberi pomudziʋisi.

Kunaka kwake kwose kwabva pamukunda weZioni;
Macinda ake aita senondo dzinoshaiwa mafuro,
Akatiza asinesimba pamberi pounodziŋgana nawo.

Namazuʋa okutambudzika nokudzuŋgaira kwaro, Jerusarema rinoraŋgarira ɀose ɀairifadza kubva pamazuʋa akare;
Paŋguʋa yakawira ʋanhu ʋaro pamaʋoko omudziʋisi, kusinawakariɓatsira,
Ʋadziʋisi ʋakariʋona, ʋakaseka kuparadzwa kwaro.

Jerusarema rakatadza ɀikuru kwaɀo, naiɀoɀo raitwa secinhu cisakanaka;
Ʋose ʋairikudza, ʋorishoʋora, nokuti ʋakaʋona kushama kwaro;
Ɀirokwaɀo, rakagomera, rikadzokera shure.

Tȿina yaro yakaŋga iri paŋguʋo yaro, harina‐kuraŋgarira kuguma kwaro;
Naiɀoɀo rakanyura ɀinoshamisa, harinamunyaradzi;
Tarirai, Jehova, kutambudzika kwaŋgu, nokuti muʋeŋgi waɀikudza.

Mudziʋisi watambanudzira ruʋoko rwake kuneɀose ɀaro ɀinofadza;
Nokuti rakaʋona marudzi acipinda panɀimbo yaro tȿene,
Ʋamakaŋga maraira pamsoro paʋo kuti ʋarege kupinda paʋuŋgano yenyu.

Ʋanhu ʋaro ʋose ʋanogomera, ʋanotȿaka ɀokudya;
Ʋakapa ɀinhu ɀaʋo ɀinofadza kuti ɀiʋe ɀokudya ɀokusimbisa mŋeya yaʋo;
Tarirai, Jehova, muʋone; nokuti ndaitwa wakaɀidzwa.

Wakatuma mŋoto mumafupa aŋgu, ɀicibva kumsoro, ukaʋakunda;
Wakadzikira tsoka dzaŋgu mumbure, akandidzosera shure;
Wakandiparadza nokundishaisa simba zuʋa rose.

Joko rokuɗarika kwaŋgu kuzhinji rakasuŋgwa noruʋoko rwake;
Ɀakarukwa, ɀaiswa pamutsipa waŋgu, ɀandishaisa simba raŋgu;
Ishe wakandiisa mumaʋoko aʋandisiŋgagoni kudziʋisa.

Ishe wakashaisa simba mhare dzaŋgu dzose mukati maŋgu;
Wakakokera ʋuŋgano yakatarwa kuzondipxanyira majaya aŋgu;
Ishe wakatsika mukunda mhandara yaJuda sapaciȿiniro.

Ndinocema nokuɗa kweɀinhu iɀi, ziso raŋgu, ziso raŋgu rinoyerera mvura,
Nokuti munyaradzi, waifanira kusimbisa mŋeya waŋgu, uri kure neni;
Ʋana ʋaŋgu ʋasiyiwa, nokuti muʋeŋgi wakunda.

Zioni rinotambanudza maʋoko aro, hakuna‐uŋgarinyaradza;
Jehova wakaraira pamsoro paJakobo, kuti ʋakamupoteredza ʋaʋe ʋadziʋisi ʋake;
Jerusarema riri pakati paʋo secinhu cisakanaka.

Jehova wakarurama, nokuti ndakamukira murairo wake;
Ƌotererai imi ʋanhu ʋose, muʋone kucema kwaŋgu;
Mhandara dzaŋgu namajaya aŋgu aenda kuʋutorwa.

Ndakaɗana ʋaindiɗa, asi ʋakandinyeŋgera;
Ʋaprista ʋaŋgu naʋakuru ʋaŋgu ʋakaparara muguta,
Paŋguʋa yaʋakaŋga ʋaciɀitȿakira ɀokudya kusimbisa mŋeya yaʋo.

Tarirai, Jehova, nokuti ndiri panjodzi, mŋoyo waŋgu unotambudzika;
Mŋoyo waŋgu washanduka mukati maŋgu, nokuti ndakakumukirai simba;
Kunze munondo unonditorera, mumba makaita somunorufu.

Ʋakandinzwa ndicigomera, hakuna‐unondiyaradza;
Ʋaʋeŋgi ʋaŋgu ʋose ʋakanzwa nhamo dzaŋgu, ʋanofara kuti makaɀiita;
Mucaʋuyisa zuʋa ramakatara, ipapo ʋacafanana neni.

Ɀakaipa ɀaʋo ɀose ŋgaɀiʋuye pamberi penyu;
Muʋaitire iʋo seɀamakandiitira ini nokuɗa kwokuɗarika kwaŋgu kwose;
Nokuti kugomera kwaŋgu kuzhinji, mŋoyo waŋgu washaiwa simba.

2:
Ishe wakamedza ʋugaro bgose bgaJakobo, akasanzwira tsitsi;
Pakutsamŋa kwake wakawisira pasi nhare dzomukunda waJuda;
Wakadziwisira pasi; wakamhura ʋushe namacinda abgo.

Nokutsamŋa kukuru wakagura nyaŋga dzose dzaIsraeri;
Wakadzosa ruʋoko rwake rworudyi pamberi pomuʋeŋgi,
Akapisa munaJakobo somuraɀo womŋoto unopedza ɀose kumatiʋi ose.

Wakawembura ʋuta bgake somuʋeŋgi, wakamira noruʋoko rwake somudziʋisi,
Akaʋuraya ʋose ʋaifadza meso;
Wakaɗurura kutsamŋa kwake somŋoto patente romukunda weZioni.

Ishe waʋa somuʋeŋgi, wakamedza Israeri;
Wakamedza dzimba dzaʋo dzose dzoʋushe, wakaparadza nhare dzaʋo;
Akawanzira mukunda waJuda kucema nokurira.

Wakabvisa ruzhowa rwake nesimba sorwomunda; wakaparadza nɀimbo yake yokuʋuŋgana;
Jehova wakakaŋganwisa paZioni ʋuŋgano yakatarwa nesaɓata,
Akashoʋora madzimambo naʋaprista neshuŋgu dzokutsamŋa kwake.

Jehova wakarasha artari yake, wakasema nɀimbo yake tȿene,
Wakaisa maȿiŋgo edzimba dzaʋo dzoʋushe mumaʋoko omuʋeŋgi;
Ʋakaita ɓope mumba maJehova, sapazuʋa reʋuŋgano yakatarwa.

Jehova wakafuŋga kuparadza ruȿiŋgo rwomukunda weZioni;
Wakatatanura rwonzi rwokuyera, haana‐kudzosa ruʋoko rwake pakuparadza;
Wakacemedza nhare noruȿiŋgo, ɀinopera simba pamŋe cete.

Masuʋo aro akanyura pasi, wakaparadza nokuvuna ɀipfigiso ɀaro;
Mambo waro namacinda aro ʋari pakati pamarudzi asinomurairo.
Ɀirokwaɀo ʋaprofita ʋaro haʋana‐ɀaʋanoratidzwa naJehova.

Ʋakuru ʋomukunda weZioni ʋagere pasi, ʋanoramba ʋanyerere;
Ʋakakushira guruʋa pamisoro yaʋo, ʋakaɀisuŋga ɀiʋuno namasaga;
Mhandara dzeJerusarema dzakakotamisa misoro yadzo pasi.

Meso aŋgu apera nemisodzi, mŋoyo waŋgu unotambudzika;
Ciropa caŋgu caɗururirwa pasi, nemhaka yokuparadzwa kwomukunda waʋanhu ʋaŋgu,
Nokuti ʋanana naʋanomna ʋanoziya munzira dzomuguta.

Ʋaprofita ʋako ʋakakuʋonera ɀiratidzo ɀenhema neɀoʋupenzi;
Haʋana‐kuɓuɗisa ɀakaipa ɀako, kuti ʋadzose kutapxa kwako,
Asi ʋakakuʋonera ɀireʋo ɀenhema neɀinokutapisa.

Ʋose ʋanopfuʋura ʋacaita nondo pamsoro pako;
Ʋanoridza muridzo nokudzuŋgudzira mukunda weJerusarema misoro yaʋo,ʋaciti:
Ko ndiro guta rainzi naʋanhu: Rakanaka‐naka kwaɀo, mufaro wenyika yose?

Ʋaʋeŋgi ʋako ʋose ʋakakushamisira miromo yaʋo;
Ʋanoridza muridzo nokugeɗa‐geɗa meno, ʋanoti: Tarimedza;
Ɀirokwaɀo ndiro zuʋa ratakaŋga takatarira; tariwana, tariʋona.

Jehova wakaita iɀo ɀaakafuŋga, wakapedzisa shoko rake raakaraira pamazuʋa akare;
Wakawisira pasi, akasaʋa netsitsi;
Wakafadza muʋeŋgi pamsoro pako, wakasimudza runyaŋga rwaʋadziʋisi ʋako.

Muka, ɗanidzira ʋusiku, pakutaŋga kweŋguʋadzose;
Ƌurura mŋoyo wako semvura pamberi paJehova;
Simudzira maʋoko ako kwaari nokuɗa kwoʋupenyu bgaʋanana ʋako, ʋanoziya nenzara pakuʋamba kwenzira imŋe neimŋe yomuguta.

Majaya naʋatana ʋaʋete pasi munzira dzomuguta;
Mhandara dzaŋgu namajaya aŋgu ʋaʋurawa nomunondo;
Makaʋaʋuraya nezuʋa rokutsamŋa kwenyu, makaɓaya, hamuna‐kunzwira tsitsi.

Makaɗana ɀinondityisa pamatiʋi ose, sapazuʋa reʋuŋgano yakatarwa;
Hakuna‐wakapukunyuka kana wakasara pazuʋa rokutsamŋa kwaJehova;
Ʋandakaɓatamumaʋoko naʋandakarera ʋakapedzwa nomuʋeŋgi waŋgu.

Nokuti makandikandira makadzika, mukati momŋoyo weguŋgwa,
Mvura zhinji yakaŋga yandikomberedza;
Mafuŋgu enyu namapoporodzi enyu akapfuʋura napamsoro paŋgu.

Mvura zhinji yakandikomberedza, kuȿikira kumŋeyawaŋgu;
Pakadzika pakaŋga pandipoteredza;
Maharaŋgwe akaŋga amonera musoro waŋgu.

Ndakaɓurukira kumaʋambiso amakomo;
Nyika neɀipfigiso ɀayo ɀakandipfigira’mo nokusiŋgaperi;
Kunyaŋge ɀakaɗaro makaɓuɗisa ʋupenyu bgaŋgu pagomba, imi, Jehova Mŋari waŋgu.

Asi ndicakuɓayirai nenzwi rokuʋoŋga;
Ndicaripa ɀandapika.
Ruponeso runobva kunaJehova.

3:
Haiwa, Jehova, ndakanzwa mashoko enyu, ndikatya;
Haiwa, Jehova, mutsai ɓasa renyu pakati pamakore;
Riziʋisei pakati pamakore;
Pakutsamŋa kwenyu raŋgarirai nyasha.

Kupenya kuri’po kwakafanana neciedza;
Bgerazuʋa ʋunoɓuɗa paruʋoko rwake,
Simba rake rinoʋanda’po.

Unomira aciyera nyika;
Unotarira, ndokuparadza marudzi aʋanhu;
Makomo asiŋgaperi anopararira;
Ɀikomo ɀisiŋgaperi ɀinokotama;
Nzira dzake ndedzekare‐kare.

Ʋuta bgenyu bgakafukurwa kwaɀo;
Shamhu dzakapikirwa neshokorenyu. Sera.
Makaparura nyika nenzizi.

Makabvoʋora misoro yaʋarwi ʋake namapfumo ake;
Ʋakaʋuya secampupuri kundiparadza;
Kufara kwaʋo kwakaita sokwaʋanopedza ʋarombo pakaʋanda.

4:
Nyika yeZaburoni, nenyika yeNeftarimi,
Panzira yeguŋgwa, mhiri kwaJoridani,
Garirea raʋahedeni;

13:
Kuprofita kwaIsaya kwakaitika kwaʋari, kunoti:
Nokunzwa, mucanzwa, musiŋgatoŋgonzwisisi;
Nokuʋona, mucaʋona, musiŋgatoŋgoʋonesesi;

1:
Seɀaɀakanyorwa mumuprofita Isaya,ɀicinzi:
Tarira, ndinotuma munyai waŋgu pamberi pako,
Ucakunatsira nzira yako;

12:
Ko hamuna‐kutoŋgoraʋa here rugwaro urwu,runoti:
Ibge rakarashwa naʋaʋaki,
Ndiro rakazoʋa musoro wekona;

3:
Mipata yose icafusirwa,
Makomo ose neɀikomo ɀose ɀicaɗeredzwa;
Ɀakakombama ɀicaruramiswa,
Pasakaenzanapacaitwa nzira dzakaenzaniswa;

4:
Mŋeya waShe uri pamsoro paŋgu,
Nokuti wakandizodza, kuti ndiparidzire ʋarombo Evaŋgeri;
Wakandituma kuti ndiziʋise ʋakatapxa kusunuŋgurwakwaʋo;
Namapofu kuti ʋaʋone ɀe;
Ndiregedze ʋakatsikirirwa;

2:
Mŋari unoti: Namazuʋa okupedzisira,
Ndicaɗurura ɀoMŋeya waŋgu pamsoro penyama yose;
Ʋanakomana ʋenyu naʋanasikana ʋenyu ʋacaprofita;
Majaya enyu acaʋona ɀiratidzo,
Naʋatana ʋenyu ʋacarota hope.

Ndicaita ɀinoshamisa kuɗeŋga kumsoro,
Neɀiratidzo panyika pasi;
Ropa, nomŋoto, nemhute yoʋutsi.

7:
Ƌeŋga ndico cigaro caŋgu coʋushe,
Nenyika citsiko cetsoka dzaŋgu;
Mucandiʋakira imba yakaɗiniko?
Ndiɀo ɀinoreʋa Ishe;
Kana nɀimbo yandiŋgazorora pairi ndeipi?

8:
Ɀino paakaŋga aciraʋa paRugwaro paiti:
Wakaiswa pakuɓayiwa segwai;
Segwaiana rinyerere pamberi pomuʋeʋuri waro,
Saiɀoɀo haana‐kushamisa muromo wake;

Pakuɀidzwa kwake kutoŋgwa kwake kwakabviswa;
Ndianiko ucarondedzera rudzi rwake?
Nokuti ʋupenyu bgake bgunobviswa panyika.

15:
Shure kwaiɀoɀi ndicadzoka,
Ndiʋake tabernakeri yaDavidi, yakawa;
Ndicaʋaka ɀe matoŋgo ayo,
Ndiciimutsa;

3:
Huro dzaʋo bgiro bgakashama;
Ʋakanyeŋgera nendimi dzaʋo;
Ʋuturu bgenyoka bguri mumiromo yaʋo;

4:
aciti:
Ʋakaropafadzwa ʋakakaŋganwirwa ɀisakarurama ɀaʋo,
Naʋakafukidzirwa ɀiʋi ɀaʋo;

8:
Seɀaɀakanyorwa,ɀicinzi:
Nokuɗa kwenyu tinoʋurawa zuʋa rose;
Takanzi tiri makwai anoɓayiwa.

9:
Seɀaɀakanyorwa,ɀicinzi:
Tarira, ndinoisa paZioni ibge rokugumbusa, neɗombo rokupiŋganidza;
Unotenda kwaari, haaŋganyadziswi.

11:
naiɀoɀorudzi rwose rwaʋaIsraeri rucaponeswa; seɀaɀakanyorwaɀicinzi:
PaZioni pacaɓuɗa Musunuŋguri;
Ucabvisa kusaɗa‐Mŋari kunaJakobo;

15:
Ʋuye ɀe:
Rumbidzai Ishe, imi ʋahedeni ʋose;
Marudzi ose ŋgaamukudze.

asi, seɀaɀakanyorwa,ɀicinzi:
Aʋo, ʋasina‐kuʋudzwa ɀake, ʋacaʋona;
Naiʋo ʋasina‐kunzwa ʋacanzwisisa.

9:
seɀaɀakanyorwa,ɀicinzi:
Iye wakaparadzira, iye wakapa ʋarombo;
Kururama kwake kunogara nokusiŋgaperi.

1:
Napamsoro paʋatumŋa unoti:
Iye unoita ʋatumŋa ʋake kuti ʋaʋe mhepo,
Naʋaranda ʋake, kuti ʋaʋe muraɀo womŋoto;

Makaɗa kururama, mukaʋeŋga kusarurama;
Saka Mŋari, iye Mŋari wenyu, wakakuzodzai
Namafuta okufara kupfuʋura shamŋari dzenyu.

Ʋuye,
Imi, Ishe, makateya nheyo dzenyika pakutaŋga,
Neɗeŋga ndiro ɓasa ramaʋoko enyu;

Mucaripeta secinofukwa,
Seŋguʋo, rikashandurwa;
Asi imi hamushanduki, namakore enyu haaŋgagumi.

3:
Naiɀoɀo ndakanzwa shuŋgu pamsoro porudzi urwu,
Ndikati: Ʋanogara ʋacitsauka pamŋoyo yaʋo;
Asi haʋana‐kuziʋa nzira dzaŋgu;

5:
Saiɀoɀo ʋo Kristu haana‐kuɀikudza iye, aciitwa muprista mukuru, asiwakakudzwa naiye, wakati kwaari:
Ndiwe Mŋanakomana waŋgu,
Nhasi ndakakuɓereka;

7:
(nokuti iʋo ʋakaitwa ʋaprista kusinemhiko, asi iye nokupika kwaiye, wakati kwaari:
Ishe wakapika, haaŋgaɀidyi mŋoyo ɀe,aciti:
Iwe uri muprista nokusiŋgaperi);

8:
Nokuti unoʋapa mhoȿa, aciti:
Tarirai, mazuʋa anoʋuya, ndiɀo ɀinotaura Ishe,
Andicaita nawo suŋgano itȿa neimba yaIsraeri, ʋuye neimba yaJuda;

Nokuti ndiyo suŋgano yandicaita neimba yaIsraeri
Kana mazuʋa iwayo apfuʋura, ndiɀo ɀinotaura Ishe;
Ndicaisa mirairo yaŋgu pakufuŋga kwaʋo,
Napamŋoyo yaʋo ndicainyora,
Ndicaʋa Mŋari waʋo,
Iʋo ʋacaʋa ʋanhu ʋaŋgu;

10:
Saka pakuȿika kwake panyika, unoti:
Ciɓayiro necipo makaɀiramba,
Asi makandigadzirira muʋiri;

Iyi ndiyo suŋgano yandicaita naʋo
Shure kwamazuʋa iwayo, ndiɀo ɀinotaura Ishe;
Ndicaisa mirairo yaŋgu pamŋoyo yaʋo,
Nokuinyor pakufuŋga kwaʋo;
Ndokuzoti:

12:
Ʋuye makakaŋganwa kwaɀo kuraira kunotaura kwamuri sokuʋanakomana,kuciti:
Mŋanakomana waŋgu, usaɀidza kuraŋga kwaShe,
Usapera mŋoyo kana ucirairwa naye;

13:
Naiɀoɀo tinotsuŋga mŋoyo, ticiti:
Ishe ndiye muɓatsiri waŋgu; handiŋgatyi;
Munhu uŋgandiiteiko?

2:
Nokuti muRugwaro ɀiri’mo,ɀinoti:
Tarira, ndinoisa muZioni ibge rekona, rakasanaŋgurwa, rinokosha;
Nounotenda kwaari haaŋganyadziswi.

Naiɀoɀo imi, munotenda, munako kukudzwa; asi kunaʋasiŋgatendi,
Ibge rakarashwa naʋaʋaki,
Ndiro rakaitwa musoro wekona;

7:
Kurudzi rwaJuda ʋakaiswa cisimbiso ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaRubeni ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaGadi ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;

Kurudzi rwaAseri ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaNeftarimi ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaManase ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;

Kurudzi rwaSimeoni ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaRevi ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaIsakari ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;

Kurudzi rwaZaburoni ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaJosefa ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri;
Kurudzi rwaBenjamini ʋakaiswa cisimbiso ʋaneɀuru ɀinegumi neɀiʋiri.
